<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Daniel Nwoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dan</para>
  <para style="mt1">Daniel</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nwoma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔyi Israelfoɔ Baanan Tete Wɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1"/>Yudahene Yehoiakim dii adeɛ ne mfeɛ mmiɛnsa mu no, Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar baa Yerusalem de nʼakodɔm bɛtuaa ɔman no. <verse eid="DAN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> maa no dii Yudahene Yehoiakim so nkonim. Ɛberɛ a Nebukadnessar resane akɔ Babilonia no, ɔtasee akronkronneɛ bi firii Onyankopɔn asɔredan mu, de kɔɔ nʼabosomdan mu kɔguu adekorabea hɔ wɔ Babilonia asase so.<verse eid="DAN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3"/>Afei, ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ nʼapiafoɔhene Aspenas sɛ, ɔmfa mmeranteɛ no bi a wɔfiri Yuda adehyeɛ abusua mu, ne wɔn a wɔfiri mmusua atitire mu a wɔde wɔn aba Babilonia sɛ nneduafoɔ no mmra ahemfie hɔ, <verse eid="DAN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4"/>mmeranteɛ ahoɔdenfoɔ a wɔn ho nni dɛm, na wɔn ho yɛ fɛ. Hwɛ sɛ wɔwɔ nhunumu, na wɔadom wɔn osuahunu mu akyɛdeɛ a wɔnim nyansa, na wɔwɔ nnyinasoɔ bi a ɛbɛma wɔatumi asom wɔ ahemfie hɔ. Kyerɛ mmeranteɛ no Kaldeafoɔ kasa ne ne nwoma. <verse eid="DAN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5"/>Ɔhene no hyɛɛ sɛ, daa wɔmfa aduane ne nsã a ɛfiri ne didipono so mmrɛ wɔn. Na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtete wɔn mfeɛ mmiɛnsa, na wɔn mu bi abɛyɛ nʼasomfoɔ.<verse eid="DAN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6"/>Mmeranteɛ baanan bi a wɔyii wɔn no ne Daniel, Hanania, Misael ne Asaria a wɔn nyinaa firi Yuda abusuakuo mu. <verse eid="DAN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7"/>Apiafoɔhene no de din foforɔ totoo wɔn. Ɔtoo Daniel Beltesasar; ɔtoo Hanania Sadrak; ɔtoo Misael Mesak ɛnna ɔtoo Asaria Abednego.<verse eid="DAN 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8"/>Na Daniel yɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔrenni aduane, nnom nsã a ɔhene no de bɛbrɛ wɔn no, ɔsrɛɛ apiafoɔhene no sɛ ɔmma no ɛkwan na wangu ne ho fi. <verse eid="DAN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9"/>Na Onyankopɔn maa Daniel nyaa apiafoɔhene no anim adɔeɛ ne mmɔborɔhunu. <verse eid="DAN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10"/>Apiafoɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ Daniel sɛ, “Me wura ɔhene no ahyɛ sɛ monni saa aduane yi, na monnom nsã no. Sɛ mofonfɔn na yɛde mo toto mmabunu a wɔyɛ mo tipɛnfoɔ no ho a, ɔhene no bɛma wɔatwa me ti sɛ, matoto mʼadwuma ase.”<verse eid="DAN 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11"/>Daniel ka kyerɛɛ ɔsomfoɔ a apiafoɔhene no de no asi ɔno ne Hanania, Misael ne Asaria so no sɛ, <verse eid="DAN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12"/>“Ma yɛn nhahamma ne nsuo dadu, na fa sɔ yɛn hwɛ. <verse eid="DAN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13"/>Afei fa yɛn toto mmeranteɛ afoforɔ no a wɔredi ɔhene nnuane pa no ho, na hwɛ sɛdeɛ yɛte. Ɛno akyi yɛ wo nkoa sɛdeɛ wohunu.” <verse eid="DAN 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14"/>Enti, ɔsomfoɔ no penee asɛm a Daniel de too nʼanim no so, sɔɔ wɔn hwɛɛ dadu.<verse eid="DAN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15"/>Dadu no akyi, wɔhunuu sɛ wɔn anim ayɛ fɛ na wɔwɔ honam sene mmeranteɛ a wɔdii ahennuane no nyinaa. <verse eid="DAN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16"/>Enti, ɔsomfoɔ no sii gyinaeɛ sɛ ɔbɛtoa so ama wɔn nhahamma nko ara, na wamfa ahennuane amma wɔn.<verse eid="DAN 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17"/>Na mmerantewaa baanan yi Onyankopɔn maa wɔn nwomanim ne nyansahu nyinaa mu nimdeɛ, na Daniel nyaa anisoadehunu ne daeɛ nkyerɛaseɛ ho nimdeɛ.<verse eid="DAN 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔhene no ahyɛ no duruiɛ no, ɔpanin no de mmeranteɛ yi nyinaa brɛɛ Nebukadnessar. <verse eid="DAN 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19"/>Ɔhene no ne wɔn nyinaa kasaeɛ, na wɔn mu biara ansɔ nʼani gye sɛ, Daniel, Hanania, Misael ne Asaria. Enti, wɔde wɔn kaa ɔhene no apiafoɔ ho. <verse eid="DAN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20"/>Asɛm biara a ɛhia nyansa ne nteaseɛ a ɔhene no bisa wɔn no ɔhunu sɛ, wɔ sene nkonyaayifoɔ ne pɛadeɛhunufoɔ a wɔwɔ nʼahemman mu nyinaa no mpɛn edu.<verse eid="DAN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21"/>Daniel tenaa hɔ ara, kɔsii ɔhene Kores adedie afe a ɛdi ɛkan mu.<verse eid="DAN 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Nebukadnessar Daeɛso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1"/>Nebukadnessar adedie mfeɛ mmienu so, ɔsosoo daeɛ bi ma ɛhaa no ara kɔsii sɛ, na ɔntumi nna. <verse eid="DAN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2"/>Ɔfrɛɛ ne nkonyaayifoɔ, pɛadeɛhunufoɔ, ntafowayifoɔ ne Kaldeafoɔ bisaa wɔn sɛ, wɔnkyerɛ no daeɛ ko no. Wɔbɛgyinaa ɔhene no anim no, <verse eid="DAN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3"/>ɔkaa sɛ, “Maso daeɛ bi a ɛha me, enti mepɛ sɛ monkyerɛ me daeɛ ko a mesoeɛ no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ mehunu.”<verse eid="DAN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4"/>Na Kaldeafoɔ no buaa no wɔ Arameike kasa mu sɛ, “Ɔhene nkwa so! Ka daeɛ no kyerɛ yɛn, na yɛbɛkyerɛ aseɛ.”<verse eid="DAN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5"/>Nanso, ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ Kaldeafoɔ no sɛ, “Yei ne gyinaeɛ a masi wɔ asɛm yi ho. Sɛ moantumi anka me daeɛ no, na moankyerɛ me aseɛ a, wɔbɛtwitwa mo mu asinasini, na wɔbɛbubu mo afie, ama afu wira. <verse eid="DAN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6"/>Na sɛ moka me daeɛ no, kyerɛ me aseɛ a, mɛma mo akyɛdeɛ a ɛso bi mmaa da, na mabɔ mo aba so. Monka daeɛ no, na monkyerɛ me aseɛ.”<verse eid="DAN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7"/>Wɔkaa bio sɛ, “Yɛsrɛ wo, Nana, ka daeɛ no kyerɛ wʼasomfoɔ, na yɛbɛkyerɛ wo aseɛ.”<verse eid="DAN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8"/>Ɔhene no buaa sɛ, “Mahunu mo nnaadaa no. Mahunu sɛ, moretwentwɛn ɛberɛ no so, na monim gyinaeɛ a masi asɛm a mekaeɛ no ho. <verse eid="DAN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9"/>Sɛ moanka daeɛ no ankyerɛ me a, asotwe baako pɛ na ɛda hɔ ma mo. Moapam sɛ mobɛdi atorɔ adaadaa me. Mosusu sɛ asɛm no bɛsesa. Monka daeɛ no nkyerɛ me, na ɛbɛma mahunu sɛ mobɛtumi akyerɛ aseɛ.”<verse eid="DAN 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10"/>Kaldeafoɔ no buaa Ɔhene no sɛ, “Onipa teasefoɔ biara nni hɔ a ɔbɛtumi akyerɛ wo, Nana, wo daeɛ a woaso no. Na ɔhene biara nso nni hɔ, sɛ ɔkorɔn anaa ne tumi so, a wabisa nkonyaayifoɔ, pɛadeɛhunufoɔ anaa Kaldeafoɔ saa asɛm yi bi pɛn. <verse eid="DAN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11"/>Ɔhene abisadeɛ yi yɛ den dodo. Obiara nni hɔ a ɔbɛtumi aka wo daeɛ no gye anyame. Nanso, wɔn tenabea nni ewiase yi mu.”<verse eid="DAN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12"/>Ɔhene no tee saa asɛm yi no, ne bo fuu yie, enti ɔhyɛɛ sɛ, wɔnkunkum anyansafoɔ a wɔwɔ Babilonia nyinaa. <verse eid="DAN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13"/>Na ɛsiane ɔhene no mmara den sɛ wɔnkunkum anyansafoɔ no enti, wɔsomaa mmarima sɛ wɔnkɔhwehwɛ Daniel ne ne nnamfonom, na wɔnkunkum wɔn.<verse eid="DAN 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14"/>Ɛberɛ a, Ariok a ɔyɛ ɔhene no awɛmfoɔ so panin baa sɛ ɔrebɛkum wɔn no, Daniel faa nyansakwan so ne no kasaeɛ. <verse eid="DAN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15"/>Daniel bisaa Ariok sɛ, “Adɛn enti na ɔhene hyɛɛ mmara a ano yɛ den saa?” Na Ariok kaa deɛ asi nyinaa kyerɛɛ no. <verse eid="DAN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16"/>Daniel kɔhunuu Ɔhene no, na ɔsrɛɛ no sɛ ɔmma no berɛ kakra na ɔbɛba abɛkyerɛ daeɛ no ase.<verse eid="DAN 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17"/>Na Daniel kɔɔ ne fie kɔbɔɔ ne nnamfonom Hanania, Misael ne Asaria asɛm a asie. <verse eid="DAN 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18"/>Ɔhyɛɛ wɔn sɛ, wɔmmisa ɔsoro Onyankopɔn sɛ, ɔnnom wɔn nʼahummɔborɔ sɛdeɛ wɔrenkum wɔn mfra anyansafoɔ nkaeɛ a wɔwɔ Babilonia no mu. <verse eid="DAN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19"/>Anadwo no, ɔdaa kɔkoamsɛm no adi kyerɛɛ Daniel wɔ anisoadehunu mu. Na Daniel kamfoo ɔsoro Onyankopɔn <verse eid="DAN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20"/>na ɔkaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:20">“Nkamfoɔ nka Onyankopɔn din daa nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:20">ɔno nko na ɔwɔ nyansa ne tumi.<verse eid="DAN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21"/>Ɔno na ɔsesa mmerɛ ne nnipa hyɛberɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:21">ɔsi ahene, na ɔtu wɔn adeɛ so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:21">Ɔma anyansafoɔ hunu nyansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:21">na ɔma nhunumu ho nimdeɛ.<verse eid="DAN 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22"/>Ɔda nneɛma a emu dɔ na ɛyɛ nwanwa adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:22">na ɔnim deɛ ahinta wɔ sum mu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:22">hann atwa ne ho ahyia.<verse eid="DAN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23"/>Meda wo ase, kamfo wo mʼagyanom Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:23">ɛfiri sɛ, woama me nyansa ne tumi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">woaka deɛ yɛbisaa wo akyerɛ me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:23">ada deɛ ɔhene bisaeɛ no adi akyerɛ yɛn.”<verse eid="DAN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daniel Kyerɛ Daeɛ No Ase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24"/>Afei, Daniel kɔhunuu Ariok a wɔahyɛ no sɛ ɔnkunkum anyansafoɔ a wɔwɔ Babilonia no, ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Nkunkum anyansafoɔ a wɔwɔ Babilonia no. Fa me kɔ ɔhene no nkyɛn, na mɛkyerɛ no ne daeɛ no ase.”<verse eid="DAN 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25"/>Na ntɛm ara, Ariok de Daniel kɔɔ ɔhene no anim kaa sɛ, “Mahunu atukɔfoɔ a wɔfiri Yuda no mu baako a ɔbɛkyerɛ wo, Nana, daeɛ no ase.”<verse eid="DAN 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26"/>Ɔhene no bisaa Daniel (a wɔsane frɛ no Beltesasar) no sɛ, “Ɛyɛ nokorɛ? Wobɛtumi akyerɛ me deɛ mehunuu wɔ me daeɛ no mu na woakyerɛ me aseɛ?”<verse eid="DAN 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27"/>Daniel buaa sɛ, “Nana, anyansafoɔ, pɛadeɛhunufoɔ, nkonyaayifoɔ anaa ntafowayifoɔ biara nni hɔ a wɔbɛtumi akyerɛ ahintasɛm a worebisa yi! <verse eid="DAN 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28"/>Nanso, Onyankopɔn bi wɔ ɔsoro a ɔda kɔkoamsɛm adi, na wakyerɛ ɔhene Nebukadnessar asɛm a ɛbɛsi daakye. Wo daeɛ no ne anisoadehunu a ɛberɛ a woda wo mpa so no wohunuiɛ nie:<verse eid="DAN 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29"/>“Nana, ɛberɛ a woreda no, wʼadwene kɔsisii nsɛm bi a ɛbɛsisi so. Deɛ ɔkyerɛ ahintasɛm mu no akyerɛ wo deɛ ɛrebɛba. <verse eid="DAN 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30"/>Na ɛnnyɛ sɛ, Nana, menim nyansa kyɛn onipa teasefoɔ biara enti, na mmom Onyankopɔn pɛ sɛ Nana nya ahintasɛm no asekyerɛ na ɔte deɛ ɛbaa nʼadwene mu no ase.<verse eid="DAN 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31"/>“Nana, wʼanisoadehunu no mu, wohunuu ohoni kɛseɛ bi sɛ ɔgyina wʼanim a ɔso pa ara na ɛharan hyɛnn na ne ho yɛ hu yie. <verse eid="DAN 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32"/>Sikakɔkɔɔ na wɔde yɛɛ ne ti; Dwetɛ na wɔde yɛɛ ne koko ne nʼabasa. Kɔbere na wɔde yɛɛ ne yafunu ne nʼasrɛ. <verse eid="DAN 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33"/>Dadeɛ na wɔde yɛɛ ne nan, na wɔde dadeɛ ne dɔteɛ a wɔde afra yɛɛ ne nantabon. <verse eid="DAN 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34"/>Na Nana, worehwɛ no, ɔboɔ bi a nsa biara nkura mu te bɛhwee dadeɛ ne dɔteɛ nantabon no so, pɛkyɛɛ no gɔsɔɔ. <verse eid="DAN 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35"/>Afei Nana, ohoni mu no nyinaa a ɛyɛ dadeɛ, dɔteɛ, kɔbere, dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ no nyinaa yam fekɔfekɔ, ma ɛyɛɛ sɛ ahuhuro berɛ mu ayuporobea so ntɛtɛ, ma mframa bɛhuu ne nyinaa kɔeɛ a, hwee anka hɔ. Nanso, ɔboɔ a ɛpem ohoni no hwee fam no danee bepɔ kɛseɛ a ɛkataa asase nyinaa so.<verse eid="DAN 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36"/>“Nana, daeɛ no nie o, afei, yɛrebɛkyerɛ wo aseɛ. <verse eid="DAN 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37"/>Nana, woyɛ ahene bebree so ɔhene. Ɔsoro Onyankopɔn ayɛ wo ahene mu ɔhene, ama wo tumi, ahoɔden ne animuonyam. <verse eid="DAN 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38"/>Ɔde ewiase nnipa, mmoa a wɔwɔ wiram ne nnomaa a wɔtu ahyɛ wo nsa. Baabiara a wɔwɔ no, wɔayɛ wo wɔn so difoɔ. Wo na woyɛ saa sikakɔkɔɔ ti no.<verse eid="DAN 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39"/>“Na wʼahemman aba nʼawieeɛ akyi no, ahemman a ɛnnto wo deɛ no bɛsɔre abɛsi wʼananmu. Sɛ saa ahemman no gu a, ahemman kɛseɛ foforɔ a ɛtɔ so mmiɛnsa a kɔbere yafunu ne asrɛ no gyina hɔ ma no no bɛsɔre adi ewiase so. <verse eid="DAN 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40"/>Nea ɛbɛdi saa ahemman no akyi no, ɛbɛyɛ ahemman a ɛtɔ so ɛnan a ɛso na ɛwɔ ahoɔden te sɛ dadeɛ. Saa ahemman no bɛbubu, ayam aman a adi ɛkan no nyinaa te sɛdeɛ dadeɛ bubu yam biribiara a ɛne no hyia no. <verse eid="DAN 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41"/>Nana, sɛdeɛ wohunu sɛ nantabon ne nansoaa yɛ dadeɛ ne dɔteɛ a adi afra no kyerɛ sɛ, saa ahemman yi mu bɛkyekyɛ. <verse eid="DAN 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42"/>Nʼafaafa bi bɛyɛ den sɛ dadeɛ, na ebi ayɛ mmerɛ sɛ dɔteɛ. <verse eid="DAN 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43"/>Saa dadeɛ ne dɔteɛ mfrafraeɛ no sane kyerɛ sɛ, saa ahemman no bɛyɛ nnipa ahodoɔ a wɔadi afra a wɔntumi nka wɔn ho mmɔ mu sɛdeɛ dadeɛ ne dɔteɛ ntumi nni afra no.<verse eid="DAN 2:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44"/>“Saa ahemfo no adedie mu no, Ɔsoro Onyankopɔn bɛbɔ ahemman bi atenaseɛ a ɛrensɛe da; na obiara renni so da. Ɛbɛdwɛre ahemman ahodoɔ yi nyinaa de wɔn aba awieeɛ, na ɛno deɛ, ɛbɛgyina afebɔɔ. <verse eid="DAN 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45"/>Ɔboɔ no a nsa biara nkura mu na ɛtwa firi bepɔ no so a ɛyam dadeɛ, kɔbere, dɔteɛ, dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ mfrafraeɛ ohoni no gyina hɔ ma saa ɔman no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 2:45">“Onyankopɔn kokuroko akyerɛ Nana, deɛ ɛbɛba daakye. Daeɛ no yɛ nokorɛ, na ne nkyerɛaseɛ yɛ kann.”<verse eid="DAN 2:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nebukadnessar Bɔ Daniel Aba So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46"/>Ɔhene Nebukadnessar bɔɔ ne mu ase wɔ Daniel anim, somm no, na ɔhyɛɛ ne manfoɔ sɛ, wɔmfa afɔrebɔdeɛ mmra, na wɔnhye aduhwam wɔ nʼanim. <verse eid="DAN 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47"/>Ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ Daniel sɛ, “Nokorɛ, wo Onyankopɔn yɛ Onyankopɔn wɔ anyame mu; ɔyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔ ahene so ahintasɛm mu kyerɛfoɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, wo na woatumi akyerɛ saa kɔkoamsɛm yi mu.”<verse eid="DAN 2:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48"/>Afei, ɔhene no maa Daniel dibea a ɛkorɔn yie sane yɛɛ no ayɛ a ɛsom bo yie. Ɔmaa Daniel bɛyɛɛ sohwɛfoɔ wɔ Babiloniaman no mu nyinaa, na ɔde no sii nʼanyansafoɔ no nyinaa so ɔhene. <verse eid="DAN 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49"/>Daniel bisa ma wɔyɛɛ Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego, Babilonia asase no so ahwɛfoɔ, na Daniel yɛɛ ɔsomfoɔ wɔ ɔhene aban mu.<verse eid="DAN 2:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Nebukadnessar Yɛ Sikakɔkɔɔ Ohoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1"/>Ɔhene Nebukadnessar yɛɛ sikakɔkɔɔ ohoni bi a na ne ɔsorokɔ yɛ anammɔn aduɔkron, na ne tɛtrɛtɛ nso yɛ anammɔn nkron. Wɔde sii Dura tata so wɔ Babiloniaman mu. <verse eid="DAN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2"/>Afei, ɔtoo nkra kɔmaa ahenemma, mpanimfoɔ, amradofoɔ, afotufoɔ, nsanaafoɔ, atemmufoɔ, asɛnnifoɔ ne ɔman no mu mpanimfoɔ sɛ, wɔmmra ohoni a wɔreda no adi no ase. <verse eid="DAN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3"/>Ɛberɛ a ahenemma, mpanimfoɔ, amradofoɔ, afotufoɔ, nsanaafoɔ, atemmufoɔ, asɛnnifoɔ ne ɔman no mu mpanimfoɔ no bɛhyiaeɛ sɛ wɔrebɛda ohoni a Ɔhene Nebukadnessar de asi hɔ adi no, wɔbɛgyinagyinaa ohoni no anim.<verse eid="DAN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4"/>Na wɔbɔɔ dawuro teaam sɛ, “Nnipa ahodoɔ ne aman ahodoɔ ne kasa ahodoɔ nyinaa montie deɛ ɔhene ahyɛ sɛ monyɛ! <verse eid="DAN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5"/>Sɛ mote abɛn, odurugya, sankuo, sankuten, atɛntɛbɛn ne nnwontodeɛ ahodoɔ nyinaa nnyegyeeɛ a, monkoto fam, na monsɔre ɔhene Nebukadnessar sikakɔkɔɔ ohoni no. <verse eid="DAN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6"/>Obiara a wankoto fam ansɔre ohoni no dɔn no ara mu no, wɔde no bɛto fononoo a ogya redɛre wɔ mu framfram mu.”<verse eid="DAN 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7"/>Enti, ɛberɛ a wɔtee abɛn, odurugya sankuo, sankuba sankuo, bɛnta, atɛntɛbɛn ne nnwontodeɛ ahodoɔ nyinaa nnyegyeeɛ no, nnipa no nyinaa ne aman ahodoɔ ne wɔn a wɔka kasa ahodoɔ nyinaa kotoo fam, sɔree ohoni a Ɔhene Nebukadnessar de asi hɔ no.<verse eid="DAN 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8"/>Nanso, Kaldeafoɔ no bi kɔɔ ɔhene no nkyɛn kɔtoatoa Yudafoɔ no sɛ, <verse eid="DAN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9"/>“Nana wo nkwa so! <verse eid="DAN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10"/>Wohyɛɛ mmara maa ɔmanfoɔ sɛ, obiara te abɛn, odurugya sankuo, sankuba sankuo, bɛnta, atɛntɛbɛn ne nnwontodeɛ ahodoɔ nyinaa nnyegyeeɛ a, ɔnkoto fam, na ɔnsɔre sika ohoni no, <verse eid="DAN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11"/>na obiara a wantie ankɔto ansɔre ohoni no, wɔde no bɛto fononoo a ogya redɛre framfram wɔ mu no mu. <verse eid="DAN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12"/>Nanso, Nana, Yudafoɔ bi a wɔn din de Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego a wode wɔn atuatua Babiloniaman ano no abu wo animtia, na wansɔre wʼanyame anaa sikakɔkɔɔ ohoni a wode asi hɔ no.”<verse eid="DAN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13"/>Ɛhɔ ara, Nebukadnessar bo fuu yie, na ɔhyɛɛ sɛ, wɔmfa Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego mmra nʼanim. Wɔde wɔn baeɛ no, <verse eid="DAN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14"/>Nebukadnessar bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego, ɛyɛ nokorɛ sɛ, moansɔre mʼanyame ne sikakɔkɔɔ ohoni a mede asi hɔ no? <verse eid="DAN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15"/>Mɛma mo ɛkwan bio. Sɛ mote abɛn, odurugya sankuo, sankuba sankuo, bɛnta, atɛntɛbɛn ne nnwontodeɛ ahodoɔ nyinaa nnyegyeeɛ no, na mokoto fam, na mosɔre ohoni a mayɛ no a, na me ne mo nni asɛm biara. Na sɛ mopo a, wɔbɛto mo agu fononoo a ogya redɛre wɔ mu no mu prɛko pɛ. Sɛ ɛba saa a, nyame bɛn na ɔbɛtumi agye mo afiri me tumi ase?”<verse eid="DAN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16"/>Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego buaa sɛ, “Ao, Nana Nebukadnessar, yɛnnye nni sɛ ɛho hia sɛ yɛyi yɛn ho ano wɔ wʼanim. <verse eid="DAN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17"/>Sɛ wɔto yɛn gu fononoo a ogya redɛre wɔ mu no mu a, Onyankopɔn a yɛsom no no bɛgye yɛn. Nana, ɔbɛgye yɛn afiri wo tumi ase. <verse eid="DAN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18"/>Na sɛ ɛba sɛ wannye yɛn mpo a, Nana nte aseɛ sɛ, sɔre deɛ, yɛrensɔre wʼanyame anaa sikakɔkɔɔ ohoni a wode asi hɔ no da biara da.”<verse eid="DAN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔde Mmeranteɛ Baasa Gu Ogyadɛreɛ Fononoo Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19"/>Nebukadnessar bo fuu Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego yie, na wampɛ wɔn anim ahwɛ. Ɔhyɛɛ sɛ, wɔmma fononoo no ogya no hyeɛ no nnɔ mmɔho nson. <verse eid="DAN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20"/>Afei, ɔhyɛɛ nʼakodɔm mu mmarima ahoɔdenfoɔ pa ara no bi sɛ, wɔnkyekyere Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego, na wɔnto wɔn ngu fononoo no mu ogyadɛreɛ no mu. <verse eid="DAN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21"/>Enti, wɔkyekyeree saa nkurɔfoɔ yi a wɔhyehyɛ wɔn ntwontwo, wɔn ntadeɛ, wɔn mmotire ne wɔn ntoma papee, too wɔn guu fononoo ogya a ɛrederɛ no mu. <verse eid="DAN 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22"/>Na ɛsiane ɔhene no abufutrasoɔ ne ɔhyɛ a ama fononoo no adɔ hyeehyeehye aborosoɔ no enti, asraafoɔ a wɔde Sadrak, Mesak, ne Abednego regu fononoo no mu no wuwuu ogyaframa no ano. <verse eid="DAN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23"/>Na Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego a wɔakyekyere wɔn pampee no hwehwee ogya fononoo a ɛrederɛ no mu.<verse eid="DAN 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24"/>Nebukadnessar gu so rehwɛ no, prɛko pɛ, ɔhuri teaam ahodwirie so guu nʼafotufoɔ no so sɛ, “Ɛnnyɛ mmarima baasa na yɛkyekyeree wɔn too wɔn guu fononoo no mu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 3:24">Wɔbuaa sɛ, “Aane, Nana, yɛyɛɛ saa pɛpɛɛpɛ.”<verse eid="DAN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25"/>Nebukadnessar teaam sɛ. “Monhwɛ! Mehunu nnipa baanan a biribiara nkyekyeree wɔn sɛ wɔnenam ogya no mu. Egya dɛreɛ no nhyee wɔn. Onipa a ɔtɔ so ɛnan no te sɛ anyame ba bi!”<verse eid="DAN 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26"/>Na Nebukadnessar twe bɛnee fononoo a ogya redɛre wɔ mu no ɛpono ano, sɛdeɛ ɔbɛtumi, teaam sɛ, “Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego, ɔsorosoro Onyankopɔn asomfoɔ, momfiri mmra! Mommra ha!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 3:26">Ɛno enti, Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego firii ogya no mu baeɛ. <verse eid="DAN 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27"/>Afei, ahenemma, mpanimfoɔ, amradofoɔ ne afotufoɔ bɛtwaa wɔn ho hyiaeɛ, na wɔhunuu sɛ, ogya no anka wɔn. Wɔn tirinwi mpo ho anka. Na wɔn ntadeɛ anhye. Na wisie mpo mmɔn wɔn ho.<verse eid="DAN 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28"/>Afei, Nebukadnessar kaa sɛ, “Ayɛyie nka Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego Onyankopɔn. Ɔsomaa ne ɔbɔfoɔ, ma wɔbɛgyee nʼasomfoɔ a wɔgye no die. Wɔbuu me ɔhene mmara so, na wɔde wɔn honam maeɛ, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔrensom na wɔrensɔre anyame biara gye wɔn Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="DAN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29"/>Ne saa enti, merehyɛ saa mmara yi sɛ ɔman, nkurɔfoɔ ne kasa ahodoɔ nyinaa mu, obiara a ɔbɛka Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego Onyankopɔn ho abususɛm no, ampa ara wɔbɛtwitwa wɔn mu asinasini na wɔadwiri wɔn afie ama adane wira. Onyame biara nni hɔ a ɔbɛtumi agye nkwa sɛɛ yi.”<verse eid="DAN 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30"/>Afei, Ɔhene Nebukadnessar maa Sadrak, Mesak ne Abednego dibea a ɛkorɔn yie wɔ Babiloniaman mu.<verse eid="DAN 3:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Dua Ho Daeɛso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1"/>Ɔhene Nebukadnessar,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="DAN 4:1">too saa nkra yi kɔmaa nnipa ne aman ne kasa ahodoɔ a ɛwɔ ewiase sɛ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="DAN 4:1">Ɛnsi mo yie mmoroso!<verse eid="DAN 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2"/>Ɛyɛ me anigye sɛ mo nyinaa ahunu biribi a ɛfa nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ a Ɔsorosoro Onyankopɔn ayɛ ama me.<verse eid="DAN 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3"/>Hwɛ sɛdeɛ ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ yɛ kɛseɛ fa!</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:3">Na hwɛ sɛdeɛ tumi a ɛwɔ nʼanwanwadeɛ no mu so fa!</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 4:3">Nʼahennie yɛ daa ahennie;</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:3">ne tumi tene kɔ awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ nyinaa so.<verse eid="DAN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4"/>Na me, Nebukadnessar, mete mʼahemfie, medi me ho so na me ho tɔ me. <verse eid="DAN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5"/>Nanso, mesoo daeɛ bi a, ɛbɔɔ me hu yie. Meda me mpa so no, mfoni a ɛfaa mʼani so ne anisoadehunu a menyaeɛ no hunahunaa me. <verse eid="DAN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6"/>Ɛno enti, mehyɛ ma wɔfrɛɛ anyansafoɔ a wɔwɔ Babilonia nyinaa sɛ wɔmmɛkyerɛ me daeɛ no ase. <verse eid="DAN 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7"/>Ɛberɛ a nkonyaayifoɔ, pɛadeɛhunufoɔ, Kaldeafoɔ ne ntafowayifoɔ no baeɛ no, mekaa daeɛ no kyerɛɛ wɔn, nanso wɔantumi ankyerɛ me aseɛ. <verse eid="DAN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8"/>Akyire yi, Daniel (a yɛtoo no din Beltesasar, a ɛyɛ me nyame din, ɛfiri sɛ, na anyame kronkron no sunsum wɔ ne mu) baa mʼanim, na mekaa daeɛ no kyerɛɛ no. <verse eid="DAN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9"/>Meka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Beltesasar, nkonyaayifoɔ panin, menim sɛ, anyame kronkron no sunsum wɔ wo mu, ɛno enti, ɛnnyɛ wo den sɛ wobɛkyerɛ ahintasɛm biara ase. Afei, me daeɛ no ni, kyerɛ me aseɛ. <verse eid="DAN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10"/>Ɛberɛ a meda me mpa so no, daeɛ a mesoeɛ ne sɛ, mehunuu dua bi a ɛsi asase mfimfini a ɛware tenteenten. <verse eid="DAN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11"/>Dua no nyini yɛɛ dutan kɛseɛ na ne tentene kɔduruu soro, a wohunu no asase so baabiara. <verse eid="DAN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12"/>Na ne nhahan yɛ frɔmm fɛɛfɛɛfɛ, na aso aba bebree, na ɛso wɔ aduane ma obiara. Na wiram mmoa te ne nwunu ase, na ewiem nnomaa nso yɛ wɔn pirebuo wɔ ne mman mu.<verse eid="DAN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13"/>“Meda me mpa so no, mehunuu ɔbɔfoɔ kronkron bi a ɔfiri soro reba fam wɔ mʼanisoadehunu no mu. <verse eid="DAN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no teaam sɛ, ‘Twa dua no to fam na twitwa ne mman no nyinaa. Poro ne nhahan no, na to nʼaba no pete. Pam mmoa no firi ne nwunu ase, na pam ewiem nnomaa no firi ne mman so. <verse eid="DAN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15"/>Nanso gya dunsini no ne ne nhini a dadeɛ ne kɔbere akyekyere, na ɛserɛ atwa ho ahyia no.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="DAN 4:15">“ ‘Afei, ma ɔsoro bosuo mfɔ no kyaww, na ma ɔne mmoa ntena wɔ wiram. <verse eid="DAN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16"/>Na ma nʼadwene nsesa na ɛnyɛ sɛ aboa deɛ. Na mfeɛ nson ntwa ne tiri so.<verse eid="DAN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17"/>“ ‘Asomafoɔ asi gyinaeɛ dada; na akronkronfoɔ abu atɛn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a ateasefoɔ nyinaa bɛte aseɛ sɛ, Ɔsorosoroni no na ɔdi ewiase ahemman so, na ɔde ma obiara a ɔpɛ, mpo, sɛ ɔyɛ onipa teta.’<verse eid="DAN 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18"/>“Beltesasar, saa daeɛ yi na me Ɔhene Nebukadnessar soeɛ. Afei, kyerɛ me aseɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, anyansafoɔ a wɔwɔ mʼahemman mu nyinaa antumi ankyerɛ me aseɛ. Na wo deɛ wobɛtumi akyerɛ me, ɛfiri sɛ, anyame kronkron sunsum no wɔ wo mu.”<verse eid="DAN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s3">Daniel Kyerɛ Daeɛ No Ase</para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19"/>Daniel (a wɔsane frɛ no Beltesasar no) tee daeɛ no, ɔyɛɛ basaa kakra; ne ho dwirii no na nʼadwene mu haa no. Nti, ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Beltesasar, mma daeɛ no ne nʼasekyerɛ mmɔ wo hu.”</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="DAN 4:19">Beltesasar buaa sɛ, “Yei deɛ, Nana, anka daeɛ no ne ne nkyerɛaseɛ no ɛmpare wo na ɛnkɔ wʼatamfoɔ so! <verse eid="DAN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20"/>Ao, Nana, wohunuu dua bi a ɛnyini yɛɛ dutan kɛseɛ a ne tentene kɔduruu soro, na wohunu no asase nyinaa so. <verse eid="DAN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21"/>Na ne nhahan yɛ frɔmm fɛɛfɛɛfɛ a aso aba bebree, na ɛso wɔ aduane ma obiara. Na wiram mmoa te ne nwunu ase, na ewiem nnomaa nso yɛ wɔn pirebuo wɔ ne mman mu. <verse eid="DAN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22"/>Nana, mesrɛ ka, saa dua no yɛ wo. Ɛfiri sɛ, woatu mpɔn, ahoɔden so ne kɛseyɛ mu. Wo kɛseyɛ no kɔduru ɔsoro, na wʼadedie no kɔ akyirikyiri kɔduru asase ano.<verse eid="DAN 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23"/>“Afei, Nana, wohunuu ɔbɔfoɔ kronkron a ɔfiri soro reba fam, na ɔreka sɛ, ‘Twa dua no to fam na sɛe no. Nanso, gya dunsini no ne ne nhini a dadeɛ ne kɔbere akyekyere, na ɛserɛ atwa ho ahyia no. Afei, ma ɔsoro bosuo mfɔ no kyaww, na ma ɔne mmoa ntena wɔ wiram. Na ma nʼadwene nsesa na ɛnyɛ sɛ aboa deɛ. Na mfeɛ nson ntwa ne tiri so.’<verse eid="DAN 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24"/>“Daeɛ no asekyerɛ nie, Nana, atɛn a Ɔsorosoroni no abu atia wo no nie. <verse eid="DAN 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25"/>Wɔbɛpam wo afiri nnipa mu, na wo ne wiram mmoa bɛtena wiram. Wobɛwe ɛserɛ te sɛ nantwie, na ɔsoro bosuo bɛfɔ wo kyaww. Mfeɛ nson bɛtwa wo tiri so akɔsi sɛ, wobɛhunu sɛ, Ɔsorosoroni no na ɔdi ewiase ahemman so, na ɔde ma obiara a ɔpɛ. <verse eid="DAN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26"/>Hyɛ a wɔhyɛ ma wɔgyaa dunsini no ne ne nhini no wɔ asase mu no kyerɛ sɛ, sɛ wohunu sɛ ɔsoro na ɛdi tumi no a, wo nsa bɛsane aka wʼahemman. <verse eid="DAN 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27"/>Ne saa enti, Ao, Nana Nebukadnessar, mesrɛ wo, tie mʼafotuo. Gyae bɔneyɛ, na yɛ deɛ ɛtene. Gyae wʼatirimuɔdensɛm na yɛ ahummɔborɔ ma ahiafoɔ, na twe wo ho firi wo tete amumuyɛ no ho. Ebia, woyɛ saa a, wobɛkɔ so adi yie.”<verse eid="DAN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28"/>Na saa nneɛma yi nyinaa baa Ɔhene Nebukadnessar so. <verse eid="DAN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 4:29"/>Abosome dumienu akyi a na ɔretu mpase wɔ ahemfie no abansoro atifi wɔ Babilonia no, <verse eid="DAN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:30"/>ɔtoo nʼani, hwɛɛ kuro no mu, na ɔkaa sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ Babilonia kuro kɛseɛ a mede me tumi akyekyere ayɛ no ɔhempɔn atenaeɛ de ahyɛ mʼahennie animuonyam ni anaa?”<verse eid="DAN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔgu so reka saa nsɛm no, nne bi firi soro baa sɛ, “Wo, Ɔhene Nebukadnessar, wɔka kyerɛɛ wo sɛ wonnyɛ ɔhene wɔ ahemman yi so bio. <verse eid="DAN 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32"/>Wɔbɛpam wo afiri nnipa mu. Wo ne wiram mmoa bɛtena wiram. Na wobɛwe ɛserɛ te sɛ nantwie. Mfeɛ nson bɛtwa wo tiri so kɔsi sɛ wobɛhunu sɛ, Ɔsorosoroni no di ewiase ahemman so, na ɔde ma obiara a, ɔpɛ.”<verse eid="DAN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33"/>Amonom hɔ ara nkɔmhyɛ no baa mu. Wɔpamoo Nebukadnessar firii nnipa mu. Ɔwee ɛserɛ te sɛ nantwie, na ɔsoro bosuo fɔɔ no kyaww. Ɔtenaa saa tebea no mu kɔsii sɛ, ne tirinwi yɛɛ atentene te sɛ ɔkɔdeɛ ntakra, na nʼabɔwerɛ yɛɛ sɛ anomaa bɔwerɛ.<verse eid="DAN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34"/>Saa ɛberɛ yi twaam no, me, Nebukadnessar, memaa mʼani so hwɛɛ soro. Mʼani baa me ho so, na mekamfo Ɔsorosoroni no, na metontom deɛ ɔte aseɛ daa no meyii no ayɛ sɛ:</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 4:34">Ne tumi yɛ daa tumi,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:34">Na nʼahennie tene kɔ awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ nyinaa so.<verse eid="DAN 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 4:35"/>Asase so nnipa nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:35">wɔmmu wɔn hwee.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 4:35">Ɔde ɔsoro tumi yɛ deɛ ɔpɛ biara.</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:35">Na nnipa a ɛwɔ asase so</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 4:35">mu biara ntumi nsi no ɛkwan</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:35">anaa ɔmmisa no sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na wɔayɛ yi?”<verse eid="DAN 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 4:36"/>Ɛberɛ a mʼani baa me ho so no, berɛ korɔ no mu ara na me anidie ne me kɛseyɛ a ɛhyɛ me ɔman no animuonyam no baeɛ. Mʼafotufoɔ ne mʼaberempɔn hwehwɛɛ me, na wɔsane de me sii mʼahennie so bio, na mʼanimuonyam bɛyɛɛ kɛse kyɛnee kane no. <verse eid="DAN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 4:37"/>Afei, me Nebukadnessar, mekamfo ma no so, hyɛ ɔsorohene animuonyam, de anidie ma no. Ne nneyɛeɛ nyinaa yɛ pɛ, na ɛyɛ nokorɛ, na ɔbɛtumi abrɛ ahantanfoɔ ase.<verse eid="DAN 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Fasuo Ho Atwerɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1"/>Mfeɛ bebree akyi no, Ɔhene Belsasar too ɛpono kɛseɛ maa ne mpanimfoɔ apem, na ɔne wɔn nom nsã. <verse eid="DAN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2"/>Ɛberɛ a nsã no ama Belsasar ani agye no, ɔhyɛɛ sɛ, wɔmfa sikakɔkɔɔ ne dwetɛ nkuruwa a nʼagya Nebukadnessar tase firii Yerusalem asɔredan mu no mmra, sɛdeɛ ɔne ne mpanimfoɔ, ne yerenom ne ne mpenafoɔ bɛnom mu nsã. <verse eid="DAN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3"/>Enti, wɔde saa sikakɔkɔɔ nkuruwa a wɔtase firii Onyankopɔn asɔredan a ɛwɔ Yerusalem mu no baeɛ, na ɔhene no ne ne mpanimfoɔ ne yerenom ne ne mpenafoɔ nom mu nsã. <verse eid="DAN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4"/>Wɔrenom nsã no, wɔkamfoo wɔn ahoni a wɔde sikakɔkɔɔ, dwetɛ, kɔbere, dadeɛ, dua ne aboɔ ayɛ no.<verse eid="DAN 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5"/>Amonom hɔ no ara, wɔhunuu sɛ, onipa nsateaa retwerɛ ɔhene ahemfie ɔfasuo no a ɛbɛn kaneadua no ho. Ɔhene no hwɛɛ nsa a ɛretwerɛ no, <verse eid="DAN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6"/>na ehu maa nʼanim daneeɛ. Sɛdeɛ ɔbɔɔ hu no maa ne kotodwe keka boboom, na ne nan mu yɛɛ mmrɛ.<verse eid="DAN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7"/>Ɔhene no teaam frɛɛ sɛ, wɔmfa pɛadeɛhunufoɔ, Kaldeafoɔ ne ntafowayifoɔ mmra nʼanim. Ɔka kyerɛɛ saa Babilonia anyansafoɔ yi sɛ, “Obiara a ɔbɛtumi akenkan atwerɛ yi, akyerɛ me aseɛ no, wɔbɛfira no tam kɔkɔɔ a ɛyɛ adehyeɛ abasobɔdeɛ, na wɔde sikakɔkɔɔ ntweaban agu ne kɔn mu. Ɔno na ɔbɛyɛ ɔman sodifoɔ a ɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa wɔ ahemman yi mu.”<verse eid="DAN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8"/>Nanso, ɔhene no anyansafoɔ no baeɛ no, wɔn mu biara antumi ankenkan atwerɛ no, ankyerɛ aseɛ amma ɔhene no. <verse eid="DAN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9"/>Enti, ɛmaa ɔhene no ho yeraa no yie, na nʼanim sesaeɛ. Nʼaberempɔn nso ho yeraa wɔn.<verse eid="DAN 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10"/>Na ɛberɛ a Ɔhemmaa no tee ɔhene ne ne mpanimfoɔ nteateam no, ɔyɛɛ ntɛm kɔɔ apontoɔ dan mu hɔ. Ɔka kyerɛɛ Belsasar sɛ, “Nana nkwa so! Nana nsuro na mma wʼanim nsesa! <verse eid="DAN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11"/>Ɔbarima bi wɔ wʼahemman mu ha a ɔwɔ anyame kronkron sunsum wɔ ne mu. Wʼagya Nebukadnessar adedie mu no, wɔhunuu sɛ, saa ɔbarima yi wɔ nteaseɛ nhunumu ne nyansa te sɛ anyame no. Wʼagya Nebukadnessar sii no panin wɔ nkonyaayifoɔ, pɛadeɛhunufoɔ, Kaldeafoɔ ne ntafowayifoɔ so wɔ Babilonia. <verse eid="DAN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12"/>Saa ɔbarima Daniel yi a ɔhene too no din Beltesasar yi adwene mu dɔ, na Onyankopɔn ho nimdeɛ ne nteaseɛ ahyɛ no ma. Ɔtumi kyerɛ daeɛ ne kasanyansa ase, na nsɛm a ɛkyere adwene no, ɔsane mu. Momfrɛ Daniel na ɔbɛkyerɛ mo atwerɛ no ase.”<verse eid="DAN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13"/>Enti, wɔkɔfaa Daniel baa ɔhene anim. Ɔhene no bisaa no sɛ, “Wone Daniel no a mʼagya Nebukadnessar faa wo nnommum de wo firii Yuda baeɛ no? <verse eid="DAN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14"/>Mate wo nka sɛ, wowɔ anyame sunsum wɔ wo mu, na nteaseɛ nhunumu ne nyansa ahyɛ wo ma. <verse eid="DAN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15"/>Wɔde anyansafoɔ ne pɛadeɛhunufoɔ baa mʼanim sɛ wɔbɛkenkan atwerɛ a ɛgu ɔfasuo yi ho yi na wɔnkyerɛ me aseɛ, nanso wɔntumi. <verse eid="DAN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16"/>Na mate wo nka sɛ wotumi kyerɛ nsɛm ase; na wosane nsɛm a ɛkyere adwene mu. Na sɛ wotumi kenkan atwerɛ a ɛwɔ ɔfasuo yi ho na wo kyerɛ me aseɛ a, wɔbɛfira wo ɔtankɔkɔɔ a ɛyɛ adehyeɛ abasobɔdeɛ, na wɔde sikakɔkɔɔ ntweaban bɛgu wo kɔn mu. Na wobɛyɛ ɔman sodifoɔ a ɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa wɔ ahemman yi mu.”<verse eid="DAN 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17"/>Daniel buaa ɔhene no sɛ, “Nana, mesrɛ, ma wʼakyɛdeɛ no ntena hɔ na fa wʼabasobɔdeɛ no ma obi foforɔ. Nanso, Nana, mɛkenkan atwerɛ no, na makyerɛ wo aseɛ.<verse eid="DAN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18"/>“Nana, Ɔsorosoro Onyankopɔn maa wʼagya Nebukadnessar kɛseyɛ, animuonyam ne anidie. <verse eid="DAN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19"/>Ɔyɛɛ no kɛse ara kɔsii sɛ, nnipa ahodoɔ nyinaa, aman nyinaa ne kasa biara duru nʼanim a, wɔn ho popo biribiribiri. Ɔkunkumm wɔn a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔkunkum wɔn, ɛnna ɔgyaee wɔn a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔgyaa wɔn. Ɔhyɛɛ wɔn a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔhyɛ wɔn animuonyam no animuonyam, ɛnna wɔn a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔbrɛ wɔn ase no, ɔbrɛɛ wɔn ase. <verse eid="DAN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20"/>Nanso, ahomasoɔ maa nʼakoma ne nʼadwene yɛɛ den no no, wɔyii no firii nʼahennwa so, sii no fam, gyee nʼanimuonyam no. <verse eid="DAN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21"/>Wɔpamoo no firi nnipa mu. Wɔmaa no aboa adwene, na ɔne wiram mmoa tenaeɛ. Ɔwee ɛserɛ te sɛ nantwie, na ɔsoro bosuo fɔɔ no kyaww kɔsii sɛ, afei ɔhunuu sɛ, sɛɛ Ɔsorosoro Onyankopɔn na ɔdi ewiase ahemman nyinaa so, na ɔno ara nso na ɔyi obi a ɔpɛ ma ɔdi so.<verse eid="DAN 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22"/>“Nanso wo, ne ba Belsasar, wonim yeinom nyinaa, nanso woammrɛ wo ho ase. <verse eid="DAN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23"/>Wama wo ho so atia Ɔsoro Awurade mmom. Woafa saa nkuruwa yi a ɛsisi wʼanim a wɔfa firii nʼasɔredan mu no. Wo ne wʼatitire ne wo yerenom ne wo mpenafoɔ anom mu nsã, ɛberɛ a morekamfo dwetɛ, sikakɔkɔɔ, kɔbere, dadeɛ, dua ne ɛboɔ anyame a wɔnhunu adeɛ, na wɔnnte asɛm, na wɔnnim hwee koraa no. Na moamfa anidie amma Onyankopɔn a ɔkura mo nkwa na ɔdi mo hyɛberɛ so no. <verse eid="DAN 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24"/>Ne saa enti, Onyankopɔn asoma nsa yi sɛ, ɛmmɛtwerɛ nkra yi.<verse eid="DAN 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25"/>“Nkra a ɛtwerɛeɛ nie:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="DAN 5:25">Mene, Mene, Tekel, Parsin.<verse eid="DAN 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26"/>“Saa nsɛm yi asekyerɛ nie:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 5:26">“Mene asekyerɛ ne wɔakan. Onyankopɔn akan wʼahennie nna a aka na watwa so de aba nʼawieeɛ.<verse eid="DAN 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27"/>“Tekel asekyerɛ ne wɔakari. Wɔakari wo wɔ nsania so, nanso woantumi sɔhwɛ no.<verse eid="DAN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28"/>“Parsin asekyerɛ ne wɔakyekyɛ mu. Wɔakyekyɛ wʼahemman mu ama Mediafoɔ ne Persiafoɔ.”<verse eid="DAN 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29"/>Afei, Belsasar ma wɔfiraa Daniel ɔtankɔkɔɔ a ɛyɛ adehyeɛ abasobɔdeɛ, de sikakɔkɔɔ ntweaban guu ne kɔn mu. Wɔsoaa no sɛ, ɔman sodifoɔ a ɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa wɔ ahemman no mu.<verse eid="DAN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30"/>Saa anadwo no ara, wɔkumm Babiloniahene Belsasar. <verse eid="DAN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 5:31"/>Na Dario a ɔfiri Mede faa ahennie no a na wadi mfirinhyia aduosia mmienu.<verse eid="DAN 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Daniel Da Agyata Amena Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1"/>Ɛsɔɔ Ɔhene Dario ani sɛ ɔbɛpa ahenemma ɔha ne aduonu de wɔn atuatua amantam a ɛwɔ ahemman no mu no ano. <verse eid="DAN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2"/>Ɔhene no sane yii Daniel ne afoforɔ baanu bi sɛ sohwɛfoɔ mpanimfoɔ a wɔhwɛ ahenemma no so, sɛdeɛ wɔbɛyɛ ahwɛyie, na ɔhene no ammɔ ka. <verse eid="DAN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3"/>Na Daniel daa ne ho adi sɛ ɔnim de wɔ sohwɛfoɔ ne ahenemma no mu, ɛno enti, Ɔhene yɛɛ nhyehyɛeɛ sɛ, ɔde no bɛsi ɔman no nyinaa so panin.<verse eid="DAN 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4"/>Ɛyɛɛ saa maa sohwɛfoɔ ne ahenemma no hwehwɛɛ sɛ wɔbɛnya Daniel ho asɛm wɔ nʼamammuo no fam, nanso wɔannya nʼadwumayɛ no ho mfomsoɔ biara, ɛfiri sɛ ɔyɛ nokwafoɔ. <verse eid="DAN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5"/>Ɛna mmarima no kaa sɛ, “Yɛrennya Daniel yi ho asɛmmɔne biara gye sɛ yɛhunu biribi a ɛfa ne nyamesom ho de asum no afidie.”<verse eid="DAN 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6"/>Enti, sohwɛfoɔ no ne ahenemma no kɔɔ Ɔhene Dario no nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Nana wo nkwa so! <verse eid="DAN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7"/>Yɛn sohwɛfoɔ, mpanimfoɔ, ahenemma, afotufoɔ ne mpanimfoɔ a aka no nyinaa apene so sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ Nana hyɛ mmara sɛ, adaduasa a ɛdi animu yi, obiara nni ho ɛkwan sɛ ɔbɛbɔ mpaeɛ akyerɛ onyame bi anaa onipa bi a ɛnyɛ wo Nana no, wɔde no bɛto agyata amena mu. <verse eid="DAN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8"/>Ɛno enti, Nana, twerɛ na fa wo nsa hyɛ saa mmara yi ase, sɛdeɛ Mediafoɔ ne Persiafoɔ mmara a wɔntumi nsesa no no teɛ.” <verse eid="DAN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9"/>Ɛno enti, ɔhene Dario twerɛɛ mmara no.<verse eid="DAN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10"/>Na Daniel tee sɛ wɔde nsa ahyɛ mmara no ase no, ɔkɔɔ fie kɔhyɛnee nʼaborɔsan dan a ne mpomma anim kyerɛ Yerusalem no. Ɛda biara ɔbuu nkotodwe bɔɔ mpaeɛ mprɛnsa daa ne Onyankopɔn ase sɛdeɛ ɔyɛ daa no. <verse eid="DAN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11"/>Mpanimfoɔ no nyinaa bɔɔ mu kɔɔ Daniel fie kɔhunuu no sɛ ɔrebɔ mpaeɛ resrɛ Onyankopɔn mmoa. <verse eid="DAN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12"/>Enti, wɔsane kɔɔ Ɔhene Dario no nkyɛn kɔkaee no ne mmara no sɛ, “Nana, woamfa wo nsa anhyɛ mmara a ɛka sɛ adaduasa a ɛdi animu yi, obiara a ɔbɛbɔ obi mpaeɛ, onyame anaa onipa na ɛnyɛ Nana no, wɔde no bɛto agyata amena mu no anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:12">Ɔhene no buaa sɛ, “Aane, saa mmara no wɔ hɔ; ɛyɛ Mediafoɔ ne Persiafoɔ mmara a wɔrentumi nsesa no.”<verse eid="DAN 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13"/>Afei, wɔka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no sɛ, “Nana, Daniel no a ɔyɛ Yuda atukɔfoɔ no mu baako no mmu wo, na ɔnni wo mmara no nso so. Ɔda so bɔ ne Onyankopɔn mpaeɛ mprɛnsa da koro.” <verse eid="DAN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14"/>Ɔhene no tee saa no, ɛhaa no yie, na ɔdwene ho ara kɔsii anwummerɛ pɛɛ ɛkwan bi a ɔbɛfa so agye Daniel nkwa.<verse eid="DAN 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15"/>Mmarima yi bɔɔ mu kɔɔ ɔhene no anim kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Nana, anidie mu, wonim sɛ, Mediafoɔ ne Persiafoɔ mmara mu no, wɔntumi nsesa mmara biara a ɔhene ahyɛ.”<verse eid="DAN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16"/>Ɔhene Dario hyɛɛ sɛ, wɔnkɔfa Daniel, na wɔnto no ntwene agyata amena no mu. Ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Daniel, wo Onyankopɔn a wosom no daa no, nnye wo.”<verse eid="DAN 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17"/>Wɔde boɔ bɛhinii amena no ano. Na Ɔhene no de nʼankasa nsɔano ne atitire nsɔano sosɔɔ ɛboɔ no sɛdeɛ obiara rentumi nyɛ Daniel ho hwee. <verse eid="DAN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18"/>Afei, ɔhene no sane kɔɔ nʼahemfie a anadwo no nyinaa, wannidi. Ɔpoo anigyedeɛ biara, na wantumi anna anadwo mu no nyinaa.<verse eid="DAN 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19"/>Adeɛ kyee anɔpatutuutu no, ɔhene no yɛɛ ntɛm kɔɔ agyata amena no ano. <verse eid="DAN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20"/>Ɔduruu hɔ no, ɔde awerɛhoɔ frɛɛ sɛ, “Daniel, Onyankopɔn teasefoɔ ɔsomfoɔ. Wo Onyankopɔn a wosom no daa no tumi gyee wo firii agyata no mu?”<verse eid="DAN 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21"/>Daniel teaam sɛ, “Nana wo nkwa so! <verse eid="DAN 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22"/>Me Onyankopɔn somaa ne ɔbɔfoɔ bɛkataa agyata no ano, sɛdeɛ wɔrentumi nyɛ me bɔne, ɛfiri sɛ, wahunu sɛ, medi bem wɔ nʼanim. Na wo, Nana nso, menyɛɛ wo bɔne biara.” <verse eid="DAN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23"/>Ɔhene no ani gyee mmorosoɔ, na ɔhyɛɛ sɛ wɔnyi Daniel mfiri amena no mu, enti woyii no. Wɔanhunu etwã biara wɔ ne ho, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔde ne ho too ne Onyankopɔn so. <verse eid="DAN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24"/>Afei, ɔhene no hyɛɛ sɛ, wɔnkɔkyere mmarima a wɔnam ntwatosoɔ so ma wɔde Daniel kɔtoo agyata amena mu no. Ɔmaa wɔtoo wɔn ne wɔn yerenom ne wɔn mma guu agyata amena no mu. Agyata no hurihuri sisii wɔn so, tetee wɔn, bobɔɔ wɔn nnompe mu ansa koraa na wɔreduru amena no ase.<verse eid="DAN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25"/>Afei, Ɔhene Dario too nkra yi kɔmaa nnipa ahodoɔ nyinaa, aman nyinaa ne kasa biara wɔ ewiase afanan nyinaa sɛ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="DAN 6:25">“Ɛnsi mo yie mmoroso!<verse eid="DAN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26"/>“Mehyɛ mmara sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ obiara a ɔwɔ mʼahemman mu suro, fɛre na ɔde anidie ma Daniel Onyankopɔn.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 6:26">“Ɔno na ɔyɛ Ɔteasefoɔ Onyankopɔn</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 6:26">na ɔwɔ hɔ daa.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 6:26">“Nʼahennie rensɛe da biara da.</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 6:26">Na ne tumi to rentwa da.<verse eid="DAN 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27"/>“Ɔyɛ amanehunu mu gyefoɔ na ɔgye nkwa nso;</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 6:27">ɔyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 6:27">wɔ ɔsoro ne asase so.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 6:27">“Ɔno na wagye Daniel</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 6:27">afiri agyata no nsam.”<verse eid="DAN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28"/>Enti, Daniel kɔɔ so dii yie wɔ Ɔhene Dario ne Persiahene Kores mmerɛ so.<verse eid="DAN 6:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Mmoa Ɛnan Ho Daeɛso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1"/>Ɔhene Belsasar adedie afe a ɛdi ɛkan wɔ Babilonia mu no, Daniel soo daeɛ, hunuu anisoadehunu ahodoɔ ɛberɛ a ɔda ne mpa so no. Ɔtwerɛɛ daeɛ no mu nsɛm titire too hɔ.<verse eid="DAN 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:2"/>Daniel kaa sɛ, “Mʼanisoadehunu no mu saa anadwo no, mehunuu ɔsoro mframa ɛnan a ɛrebobɔ fa ɛpo kɛseɛ no so. <verse eid="DAN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3"/>Afei, mmoa akɛseɛ ɛnan bi pue firii ɛpo no mu a wɔn mu biara bɔbea nko.<verse eid="DAN 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4"/>“Na aboa a ɔdi ɛkan no te sɛ gyata a ɔwɔ ɔkɔdeɛ ntaban. Mehwɛɛ no ara kɔsii sɛ wɔtutuu ne ntaban no, na wɔpagyaa no ma ɔgyinaa ne nan mmienu so te sɛ onipa. Na wɔmaa no onipa adwen.<verse eid="DAN 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5"/>“Afei, mehunuu aboa a ɔtɔ so mmienu a na ɔte sɛ sisire. Na ɔda ne nkyɛn mu a na mfempadeɛ mmiɛnsa hyɛ ne se ntam wɔ nʼanom. Na wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Sɔre na we ɛnam a wobɛtumi!’<verse eid="DAN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6"/>“Yei akyi no, mehunuu aboa foforɔ a ɔte sɛ ɔsebɔ. Na ɔwɔ ntaban ɛnan a ɛte sɛ nnomaa ntaban a ɛtuatua nʼakyi. Saa aboa yi wɔ tire ɛnan, na wɔmaa no tumi kɛseɛ.<verse eid="DAN 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7"/>“Yei akyi no, mʼanisoadehunu anadwo no, mehunuu aboa a ɔtɔ so ɛnan a ne ho yɛ hu yie, na ne ho yɛ den nso. Ɔwɔ se akɛseɛ a ɛyɛ dadeɛ na ɔde bubu mmoa a ɔkyere wɔn na wawe, na afei ɔde ne nan tiatia nkaeɛ no so. Ɔda nso koraa wɔ mmoa nkaeɛ no mu. Na ɔwɔ mmɛn edu.<verse eid="DAN 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8"/>“Ɛberɛ a megu so redwene mmɛn no ho no, abɛn ketewa foforɔ bi pueɛ wɔ mmɛn dada no ntam, na ɛtutuu mmɛn dada no mu mmiɛnsa. Na saa abɛn ketewa no wɔ aniwa te sɛ onipa, na ɔwɔ ano a ɛkasa ahantan so.<verse eid="DAN 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9"/>“Megu so rehwɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">“mehunuu sɛ, wɔde nhennwa bɛsisii hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:9">na Deɛ ɔwɔ hɔ firi Tete no bɛtenaa ase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Na nʼatadeɛ yɛ fitaa sɛ sukyerɛmma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:9">na ne tirinwi hoa sɛ odwan nwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Nʼahennwa dɛre sɛ ogyaframa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:9">na nʼahennwa nhankra nso dɛree framfram.<verse eid="DAN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10"/>Na ogya a ɛte sɛ asubɔnten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:10">tene firii nʼanim baeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">Abɔfoɔ mpempem kotoo no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:10">na ɔpepe nso gyinagyinaa nʼanim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">Abadwafoɔ no tenaa ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:10">na wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ buebuee nwoma mu.<verse eid="DAN 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11"/>“Na mekɔɔ so hwɛeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, na abɛn ketewa no de ahantan rekasa. Mehwɛeɛ ara kɔsii sɛ wɔkumm aboa no, na wɔtoo no twenee ogyaframa a ɛrederɛ framfram no mu. <verse eid="DAN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12"/>Mmoa a aka no nso, wɔgyee wɔn tumi firii wɔn nsam, ma wɔtenaa ase kyɛree kakra.<verse eid="DAN 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13"/>“Anadwo a menyaa mʼanisoadehunu no, mehwɛ hunuu obi te sɛ onipa ba no a ɔnam ɔsoro omununkum mu reba. Ɔbɛn Deɛ ɔwɔ hɔ firi Tete no, wɔdii nʼanim kɔɔ ne nkyɛn. <verse eid="DAN 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14"/>Wɔmaa no tumi, animuonyam ne adehyetumi; na aman ne kasa ahodoɔ nyinaa somm no. Nʼahennie yɛ daa ahennie a ɛtoɔ rentwa da. Nʼahemman yɛ deɛ ɛrensɛe da.”<verse eid="DAN 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔkyerɛ Daeɛ No Ase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15"/>“Me, Daniel, deɛ mehunuiɛ no nyinaa haa me wɔ honhom mu, na mʼanisoadehunu no bɔɔ me hu. <verse eid="DAN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16"/>Enti, mekɔɔ wɔn a wɔgyinagyina hɔ no mu baako, kɔbisaa no saa nneɛma no nyinaa ase.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 7:16">“Ɔkyerɛɛ me aseɛ sɛ: <verse eid="DAN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17"/>‘Saa mmoa akɛseɛ ɛnan yi gyina hɔ ma ahemman ɛnan a wɔbɛsɔre asase so. <verse eid="DAN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18"/>Nanso, Ɔsorosoroni no ahotefoɔ no bɛgye ahemman no na wɔafa no afebɔɔ.’<verse eid="DAN 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19"/>“Afei, mepɛɛ sɛ mehunu aboa a ɔtɔ so ɛnan no a na ɔda nso wɔ nkaeɛ no mu no nkyerɛaseɛ. Na ne ho yɛ hu yie, na ɔde ne se a ɛyɛ dadeɛ ne nʼabɔwerɛ a ɛyɛ kɔbere no tete mmoa a ɔkyere wɔn no we, na afei ɔde ne nan tiatia nkaeɛ no so. <verse eid="DAN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20"/>Afei, mepɛɛ sɛ mete mmɛn edu a na ɛtuatua ne tiri ho ne deɛ ɛpuee akyire no ase. Ɛbɛsɛee deɛ na ɛwɔ hɔ dada no mu mmiɛnsa, na yei yɛ abɛn a ɛdi mu kyɛn nkaeɛ no a na ɛwɔ onipa aniwa ne ano a ɛkasa ahantan so. <verse eid="DAN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21"/>Mehwɛeɛ no, na saa abɛn yi atu ateneneefoɔ no so sa redi wɔn so nkonim, <verse eid="DAN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22"/>kɔsii sɛ, Deɛ ɔwɔ ho firi Tete no baeɛ, bɛbuu atɛn, maa Ɔsorosoroni ahotefoɔ no dii bem. Afei, ɛberɛ duruiɛ sɛ, wɔfa ahemman no.<verse eid="DAN 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23"/>“Afei, ɔkyerɛɛ me aseɛ sɛ, ‘Saa aboa a ɔtɔ so ɛnan yi yɛ ahemman a ɛtɔ so ɛnan a ɛbɛba asase so. Ɛbɛda nso wɔ ahemman a aka no nyinaa mu. Ɛbɛmene asase nyinaa, na atiatia so abubu no asinasini. <verse eid="DAN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24"/>Ne mmɛn edu no yɛ ahemfo edu a wɔbɛfiri saa ahemman no mu. Afei, ɔhene foforɔ bɛsɔre a ɔda nso wɔ edu a aka no mu a ɔbɛbrɛ ahemfo no mu mmiɛnsa ase. <verse eid="DAN 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25"/>Ɔbɛkasa atia Ɔsorosoroni no, na wahyɛ ahotefoɔ no so. Ɔbɛbɔ mmɔden sɛ, ɔbɛsesa wɔn afahyɛ kronkron ahodoɔ ne wɔn mmara no, na wɔde wɔn ahyɛ nʼase kɔsi mmerɛ bi.<verse eid="DAN 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26"/>“ ‘Nanso, abadwafoɔ bɛtena ase, na wɔagye ne tumi nyinaa, na wɔasɛe no korakora. <verse eid="DAN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27"/>Afei, wɔde ahennie ne tumi ne kɛseyɛ a ɛwɔ ahemman a ɛwɔ ɔsoro ase nyinaa bɛma ahotefoɔ, Ɔsorosoroni no nkurɔfoɔ. Na nʼahemman bɛtena hɔ daa, na ahemfo nyinaa bɛsɔre no na wɔayɛ ɔsetie ama no.’<verse eid="DAN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28"/>“Asɛm no awieeɛ nie. Me, Daniel, mʼadwendwene yi haa me yie na mʼanim sesaeɛ na mede saa nsɛm yi siee mʼakoma mu.”<verse eid="DAN 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Odwenini Ne Ɔpapo Ho Anisoadehunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1"/>Ɔhene Belsasar adedie mfeɛ mmiɛnsa so, me, Daniel, menyaa anisoadehunu foforɔ bi a na ɛdi deɛ ada ne ho adi akyerɛ me dada no akyi. <verse eid="DAN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2"/>Mʼanisoadehunu mu no, mehunuu sɛ na mewɔ Susa abankɛsewa a ɛwɔ Elam mantam; na mʼanisoadehunu mu no, na mewɔ Nsuka Ulai ho. <verse eid="DAN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3"/>Memaa mʼani so no, mehunuu odwennini a ɔwɔ mmɛn atentene mmienu na ɔgyina nsuka no ho wɔ mʼanim. Na ne mmɛn no woware. Na ne mmɛn no baako ware sene baako, nanso deɛ ɛware no na ɛnyinii akyire koraa. <verse eid="DAN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4"/>Mehwɛɛ odwennini no sɛ ɔrepempem kɔ atɔeɛ, atifi ne anafoɔ fam. Na aboa biara ntumi nnyina nʼanim, na obiara nni hɔ a ɔbɛtumi agye obi foforɔ afiri ne nsa mu. Ɔyɛɛ deɛ ɔpɛ, na ɔyɛɛ kɛseɛ.<verse eid="DAN 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5"/>Ɛberɛ a megu so redwene yie ho no, prɛko pɛ, ɔpapo bi a ɔwɔ abɛn kɛseɛ bi a ɛtua nʼani mmienu no ntam pue firii atɔeɛ fam, twaam faa asase no nyinaa so a ne nan mpo nka fam. <verse eid="DAN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6"/>Ɔde nʼani kyerɛɛ odwennini a ɔwɔ mmɛn mmienu no a mehunuu sɛ na ɔgyina nsuka no ho no. Na ɔde ahoɔden tuu mmirika kɔɔ no so. <verse eid="DAN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7"/>Ɔpapo no sii ntɔkwanan a emu yɛ den, na ɔpem odwennini bubuu ne mmɛn mmienu no. Odwenini no yɛɛ mmerɛ na wantumi annyina ɔpapo no anim; enti ɔpapo no pem no hwee fam, tiatiaa no so, na obiara antumi annye no amfiri ne nsa mu. <verse eid="DAN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8"/>Ɔpapo no bɛyɛɛ ɔniɛdenfoɔ kɛseɛ. Nanso, nʼaniɛden no duruu ne mpɔmpɔnsoɔ no, nʼabɛn kɛseɛ no buiɛ, na nʼanan mu no, mmɛn akɛseɛ ɛnan fifiriiɛ a ɛkyerɛkyerɛ ɔsoro mframa ɛnan no so.<verse eid="DAN 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9"/>Abɛn foforɔ bi pueeɛ mmɛn akɛseɛ no mu baako ho. Ɛhyɛɛ aseɛ kakraa bi, na ne tumi yɛɛ kɛseɛ kɔɔ anafoɔ ne apueeɛ fam, de kɔɔ Asase Fɛɛfɛ no so. <verse eid="DAN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10"/>Ɛnyiniiɛ ara kɔkaa ɔsoro asafo, na ɔtotoo asafo no mu bi a wɔyɛ nsoromma bɛguguu fam, tiatiaa wɔn so. <verse eid="DAN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11"/>Na ɔmaa ne ho so bɛyɛɛ ne ho kɛseɛ sɛ ɔsoro asafo no Sahene. Ɔgyee daa daa afɔdeɛ firii ne nsam, na ɔsɛee ne kronkron tenabea hɔ. <verse eid="DAN 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12"/>Esiane atuateɛ no enti, wɔde ahotefoɔ asafo no ne wɔn daa daa afɔdeɛ maa no. Na wɔtoo nokorɛ tweneeɛ.<verse eid="DAN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13"/>Afei, metee ɔkronkronni bi sɛ ɔrekasa, na ɔkronkronni foforɔ bisaa no sɛ, “Ɛberɛ bɛn na anisoadehunu yi bɛba mu—deɛ ɛfa daa daa afɔdeɛ, atuateɛ a ɛde ɔsɛeɛ ba, kronkron tenabea a wɔbɛgyaa mu ama, ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asafo a wɔbɛtiatia wɔn so no?”<verse eid="DAN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14"/>Ɔbuaa no sɛ, “Ɛbɛdi anwummerɛ ne anɔpa 2,300, ansa na wɔasane ate kronkron tenabea no ho.”<verse eid="DAN 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anisoadehunu No Nkyerɛaseɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15"/>Ɛberɛ a me Daniel, merehwɛ anisoadehunu na mepɛɛ sɛ mete aseɛ no, obi a ɔte sɛ ɔbarima bɛgyinaa mʼanim. <verse eid="DAN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16"/>Na metee onipa nne a ɛrefrɛ firi Ulai mu sɛ, “Gabriel, kyerɛ saa ɔbarima yi anisoadehunu no ase.”<verse eid="DAN 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17"/>Ɔrebɛn baabi a na megyina no, mesuroeɛ, na mede mʼanim butuu fam. Ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Onipa ba, te aseɛ sɛ anisoadehunu no fa awieɛberɛ no ho.”<verse eid="DAN 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔrekasa akyerɛ me no, medaa nnahɔɔ a mʼanim butu fam. Na ɔsɔɔ me mu de me gyinaa me nan so.<verse eid="DAN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19"/>Ɔkaa sɛ, “Merebɛka deɛ ɛbɛsi akyire no wɔ abufuberɛ mu akyerɛ wo, ɛfiri sɛ anisoadehunu no fa awieeɛ ɛberɛ a wɔahyɛ no ho. <verse eid="DAN 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20"/>Odwennini a ɔwɔ mmɛn mmienu no gyina hɔ ma Media ne Persia ahemfo no. <verse eid="DAN 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21"/>Ɔpapo niɛdenfoɔ no yɛ Helahene, na abɛn kɛseɛ a ɛtua nʼani ntam no yɛ ɔhene a ɔdi ɛkan no. <verse eid="DAN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22"/>Mmɛn ɛnan a ɛbɛsii abɛn a ɛbubuu no anan mu no gyina hɔ ma ahennie ɛnan a ɛbɛsɔre afiri ne ɔman no mu, nanso wɔn tumidie renyɛ pɛ.<verse eid="DAN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23"/>“Wɔn adedie no rekɔ awieeɛ no, ɛberɛ a atuatefoɔ no ayɛ atirimuɔden mmorosoɔ no, ɔhene a ɔyɛ den, na ɔdi kontonkyisɛm bɛsɔre. <verse eid="DAN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24"/>Ɔbɛyɛ den yie a ɛmfiri nʼankasa tumi mu. Ɔbɛsɛe adeɛ ama nnipa ho adwiri wɔn, na ɔbɛdi nkonim wɔ biribiara a ɔbɛyɛ mu. Ɔbɛsɛe ahoɔdenfoɔ ne akronkronfoɔ. <verse eid="DAN 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25"/>Ɔbɛma nnaadaa agye ntini, na ɔbɛyɛ ahomasoɔ. Ɔbɛsɛe bebree a ɔmmɔ nkaeɛ, na ɔbɛsɔre atia ahenemma mu Ɔheneba no, nanso wɔbɛsɛe no a ɛmfiri onipa ahoɔden mu.<verse eid="DAN 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26"/>“Anwummerɛ ne anɔpa anisoadehunu a wɔde ama wo no yɛ nokorɛ, nanso, sɔ ano, ɛfiri sɛ ɛfa daakye bi a ɛnnya mmaeɛ ho.”<verse eid="DAN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27"/>Me, Daniel, meyɛɛ mmerɛ, na meyaree nna kakra. Akyire yi, mesɔre kɔyɛɛ ɔhene adwuma. Anisoadehunu no yɛɛ me ahodwirie; na ɛboro nteaseɛ so.<verse eid="DAN 8:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Daniel Mpaeɛbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1"/>Ahasweros babarima Dario (a nʼase firi Media) a wɔyɛɛ no ɔhene wɔ Babilonia ahennie so no <verse eid="DAN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:2"/>afe a ɛdi ɛkan no, me, Daniel, metee aseɛ firii atwerɛsɛm mu sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de maa Odiyifoɔ Yeremia sɛ, Yerusalem bɛda mpan mfirinhyia aduɔson. <verse eid="DAN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3"/>Ɛno enti, mefiraa ayitoma de nsõ huraa me ho dii mmuada. Afei mede nkotosrɛ kɔɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Onyankopɔn anim kɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ srɛɛeɛ. <verse eid="DAN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4"/>Mebɔɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> me Onyankopɔn mpaeɛ, na mepaee mu kaa sɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="DAN 9:4">“Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo a wo so na woyɛ Onyankopɔn nwanwani! Wo a wodi ɔdɔ apam so—ɔdɔ apam a woayɛ ama wɔn a wɔdɔ wo na wɔdi wo mmara so. <verse eid="DAN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5"/>Yɛayɛ bɔne, na yɛayɛ mfomsoɔ. Yɛabɔ atirimuɔden na yɛate atua; yɛakwati wo mmara ne wo nhyɛ. <verse eid="DAN 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6"/>Yɛantie wʼasomfoɔ adiyifoɔ a wɔkasaa wɔ wo din mu kyerɛɛ yɛn ahemfo ne ahenemma ne agyanom ne nnipa a wɔwɔ asase no so nyinaa.<verse eid="DAN 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7"/>“<char style="nd">Awurade</char>, woyɛ ɔteneneeni, nanso ɛnnɛ deɛ, yɛn anim agu ase, Yudafoɔ ne Yerusalemfoɔ ne Israelfoɔ nyinaa, wɔn a wɔbɛn ne wɔn a wɔwɔ akyirikyiri a wɔabɔ apansam. Esiane yɛn amumuyɛ enti, yɛn anim agu ase. <verse eid="DAN 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8"/>Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, aniwuo aka yɛn ne yɛn ahemfo, ahenemma ne yɛn agyanom, ɛfiri sɛ, yɛayɛ bɔne atia wo. <verse eid="DAN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9"/>Ɛwom sɛ, yɛate <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn anim atua, nanso ɔyɛ ahummɔborɔ na ɔde bɔne kyɛ. <verse eid="DAN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10"/>Yɛanyɛ ɔsetie amma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn, na yɛanni ne mmara a ɔnam nʼasomfoɔ adiyifoɔ so de maa yɛn no so. <verse eid="DAN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11"/>Israel nyinaa abu wo mmara so, na wɔafiri ho a wɔmpɛ sɛ wɔyɛ ɔsetie ma wo.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="DAN 9:11">“Enti, nnome ne atemmuo a wɔaka ntam atwerɛ wɔ Onyankopɔn ɔsomfoɔ Mose Mmara mu no, wɔahwie agu yɛn so, sɛ yɛayɛ bɔne atia wo enti. <verse eid="DAN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12"/>Ɔhaw kɛseɛ a wobɔɔ ho kɔkɔ sɛ wobɛyɛ atia yɛn ne yɛn ahemfo no, woayɛ. Ɔsoro ase nyinaa, biribiara nsii sɛdeɛ asi wɔ Yerusalem no bi da. <verse eid="DAN 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13"/>Sɛdeɛ wɔatwerɛ wɔ Mose mmara mu no, saa amanehunu yi nyinaa aba yɛn so, nanso yɛnhwehwɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn mmɔborɔhunu, sɛ yɛbɛfiri yɛn bɔne ho na yɛapɛ nokorɛ akyiri ɛkwan. <verse eid="DAN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> antwentwɛn sɛ ɔde amanehunu no bɛba yɛn so, ɛfiri sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn yɛ pɛ biribiara a ɔyɛ mu, nanso yɛanyɛ ɔsetie amma no.<verse eid="DAN 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15"/>“Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn, wo a wode nsa a ɛyɛ den yii wo nkurɔfoɔ firii Misraim, de gyee din a atena hɔ abɛsi ɛnnɛ yi, yɛayɛ bɔne, yɛayɛ mfomsoɔ. <verse eid="DAN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, sɛdeɛ wo tenenee nneyɛɛ nyinaa teɛ no enti, yi wʼabofuo ne wʼanibereɛ firi wo kuropɔn Yerusalem ne wo bepɔ kronkron no so. Esiane yɛn bɔne ne yɛn agyanom amumuyɛ enti, nnipa a atwa Yerusalem ho ahyia no nyinaa di Yerusalem ne wo nkurɔfoɔ ho fɛw.<verse eid="DAN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17"/>“Na afei yɛn Onyankopɔn, tie wʼakoa mpaeɛbɔ, ne ne nkotosrɛ. Wo enti, Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, te wʼanim bio kyerɛ wo kronkronbea hɔ a agyigya no. <verse eid="DAN 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18"/>Yɛ aso, Ao, me Onyankopɔn na tie; bue wʼani, na hwɛ kuropɔn a wo Din da soɔ a agyigya no. Ɛnyɛ yɛn tenenee enti na yɛde yɛn nkotosrɛ aba wʼanim, na mmom ɛyɛ wo mmɔborɔhunu bebrebe no enti. <verse eid="DAN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19"/>Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, tie! Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, fa kyɛ! Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, tie na yɛ! Wo enti, me Onyankopɔn, ntwentwɛn wo nan ase, ɛfiri sɛ, wo Din da wo kuropɔn ne wo nkurɔfoɔ so.”<verse eid="DAN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gabriel Kyerɛ Daniel Anisoadehunu No Ase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20"/>Ɛberɛ a merekasa na merebɔ mpaeɛ, na mereka me ne me nkurɔfoɔ Israelfoɔ bɔne akyerɛ, na mede mʼadesrɛ reto <char style="nd">Awurade</char> me Onyankopɔn anim ama ne bepɔ kronkron no, <verse eid="DAN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21"/>na megu so rebɔ mpaeɛ no, Gabriel a mehunuu no kane anisoadehunu mu no de ahoɔherɛ baa me nkyɛn bɛyɛ anwummerɛ afɔrebɔ berɛ mu. <verse eid="DAN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22"/>Ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Daniel, maba ha sɛ merebrɛ wo nhunumu ne nteaseɛ. <verse eid="DAN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23"/>Wohyɛɛ aseɛ sɛ worebɔ mpaeɛ pɛ no, mmuaeɛ baeɛ, na maba sɛ merebɛka akyerɛ wo, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔbu wo yie. Enti dwene asɛm no ho na te anisoadehunu no ase.<verse eid="DAN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24"/>“ ‘Mmerɛ aduɔson ahodoɔ nson’ na wɔahyɛ ama wo nkurɔfoɔ ne wo kuropɔn kronkron no, sɛ wɔgyae mmarato, na wɔtwa bɔneyɛ so, na wɔpata atirimuɔden, na tenenee a ɛto ntwa da ba, na wɔsɔ anisoadehunu ne nkɔmhyɛ ano, na wɔsra Kronkron mu Kronkronbea hɔ ngo.<verse eid="DAN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25"/>“Tie na te yei ase: Ɛfiri ɛberɛ a asɛm no bɛkɔ ama wɔasi Yerusalem ayɛ no foforɔ, kɔsi sɛ Deɛ Wɔasra no Ngo no bɛba no bɛyɛ mmerɛ nson ahodoɔ ‘nson’, ne aduosia mmienu ahodoɔ ‘nson’. Wɔbɛyiyi mmorɔno ne akwan na wɔayɛ abanbɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ den, nanso ɛbɛyɛ ahohiahia berɛ mu. <verse eid="DAN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26"/>Mmerɛ aduosia mmienu ahodoɔ nson akyi no, wɔbɛkum Deɛ Wɔasra no ngo no a wɔrennya ne ho asɛm biara. Ɔhene a ɔbɛba no nkurɔfoɔ bɛba abɛsɛe kuropɔn ne kronkronbea no. Awieeɛ no bɛba sɛ nsuyire, na ɔko ne emu ahoyera bɛba akɔsi awieeɛ sɛdeɛ wɔahyɛ no. <verse eid="DAN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27"/>Ɔbɛsi ɔno ne nnipa bebree ntam apam so dua wɔ mmerɛ ‘nson’ baako mu. Na mmerɛ ‘nson’ no mfimfini no, ɔbɛgyae afɔrebɔ ne ayɛyɛdeɛ ma. Ɔbɛdua abusudeɛ a ɛde ɔsɛeɛ bɛba wɔ asɔredan no no mu, kɔsi sɛ awieeɛ a wɔahyɛ no bɛhwie agu ne so.”<verse eid="DAN 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Daniel Hunu Ɔbɔfoɔ Wɔ Anisoadehunu Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1"/>Persiahene Kores adedie afeɛ a ɛtɔ so mmiɛnsa mu no, wɔyii asɛm bi adi kyerɛɛ Daniel (a na wɔfrɛ no Beltesasar). Na nkra no yɛ nokorɛ, na ɛfa ɔko kɛseɛ bi ho. Ɔnyaa nkra no asekyerɛ wɔ anisoadehunu mu.<verse eid="DAN 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, me, Daniel, medii awerɛhoɔ nnawɔtwe mmiɛnsa. <verse eid="DAN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3"/>Manni aduane pa biara. Ɛnam anaa nsã biara anka mʼano, na mamfa sradehwam ansra kɔsii nnawɔtwe mmiɛnsa no awieeɛ.<verse eid="DAN 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4"/>Ɔbosome a ɛdi ɛkan no, da a ɛtɔ so aduonu ɛnan, ɛberɛ a megyina asubɔnten kɛseɛ Tigris konkɔn so no, <verse eid="DAN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5"/>mepagyaa mʼani na mehunuu ɔbarima bi a ɔfira nweratam. Na ɔbɔ sikakɔkɔɔ amapa abɔsoɔ a ɛfiri Ufas wɔ nʼasene mu. <verse eid="DAN 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6"/>Ne onipadua no te sɛ aboɔdenboɔ. Nʼanim te sɛ anyinam, nʼani te sɛ ogyatɛn a ɛrederɛ, ne nsa ne nan te sɛ yaawa a wɔabere ho hyerɛn, na ne nne nso te sɛ nipakuo nnyegyeɛ.<verse eid="DAN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7"/>Me, Daniel nko ara na mehunuu saa anisoadehunu no; nnipa a na wɔka me ho no anhunu hwee. Ehu kɛseɛ bi bɔɔ wɔn ma wodwane kɔtetɛeɛ. <verse eid="DAN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8"/>Enti, ɛkaa me nko ara a merehwɛ anisoadehunu kɛseɛ yi. Na mʼahoɔden asa, mʼanim too hoa, afei na menni ɔboafoɔ biara. <verse eid="DAN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9"/>Na metee sɛ ɔrekasa, na meretie no no, mefaa mu daa nnahɔɔ a mʼanim butu fam.<verse eid="DAN 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10"/>Nsa bi sɔɔ me mu, pagyaa me a me nsa ne me kotodwe rewoso biribiribiri. <verse eid="DAN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11"/>Ɔkaa sɛ, “Daniel, wo a wɔbu wo yie, dwene nsɛm a merebɛka akyerɛ wo yi ho. Gyina pintinn, na wɔasoma me wɔ wo nkyɛn.” Ɔkaa saa asɛm yi kyerɛɛ me no, mede ahopopoɔ sɔreeɛ.<verse eid="DAN 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12"/>Afei, ɔkɔɔ so kaa sɛ, “Nsuro, Daniel. Ɛfiri da a ɛdi ɛkan a wopɛɛ sɛ wote anisoadehunu no ase na wobrɛɛ wo ho ase wɔ wo Onyankopɔn anim no na ɔtee wo nsɛm, na ɛno enti na maba yi. <verse eid="DAN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13"/>Nanso, ɔhene babarima a ɔfiri Persia ahennie mu sii me ɛkwan nnafua aduonu baako. Afei, Mikael a ɔyɛ ahenemma atitire no mu baako bɛboaa me, ɛfiri sɛ na wɔde me asie wɔ Persia ɔhene nkyɛn. <verse eid="DAN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14"/>Seesei, maba sɛ merebɛkyerɛkyerɛ wo deɛ ɛbɛba wo nkurɔfoɔ so daakye, ɛfiri sɛ saa anisoadehunu yi fa berɛ bi a ɛrebɛba ho.”<verse eid="DAN 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔreka yei akyerɛ me no, mebɔɔ me mu ase, na metɔree mum. <verse eid="DAN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16"/>Afei, obi a ɔte sɛ onipa de ne saa kaa mʼano, na mebuee mʼano, hyɛɛ aseɛ kasaeɛ. Meka kyerɛɛ deɛ ɔgyina mʼanim no sɛ, “Anisoadehunu no ama me ho adwiri me, me wura, na menni ɔboafoɔ biara. <verse eid="DAN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17"/>Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na wʼakoa bɛtumi ne wo akasa, me wura? Mʼahoɔden asa, na mentumi nhome.”<verse eid="DAN 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18"/>Deɛ ɔte sɛ onipa no de ne nsa kaa me bio, na ɔmaa me ahoɔden. <verse eid="DAN 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Nsuro, wo a wɔbu wo bebree. Asomdwoeɛ nka wo. Hyɛ wo ho den. Yɛ den.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 10:19">Ɔkasa kyerɛɛ me no, menyaa ahoɔden na mekaa sɛ, “Sɛ woama me ahoɔden yi, kasa, me wura.”<verse eid="DAN 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20"/>Enti ɔbisaa sɛ, “Wonim deɛ enti a maba wo nkyɛn? Ɛrenkyɛre, mɛsane akɔ na me ne Persia ɔhene babarima akɔko, na sɛ mekɔ a, Hela ɔhene babarima bɛba; <verse eid="DAN 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:21"/>nanso, mɛdi ɛkan aka deɛ wɔatwerɛ wɔ Nokorɛ Nwoma no mu no akyerɛ wo. (Obiara nni mʼafa a ɔko tia wɔn, gye sɛ Mikael a ɔyɛ wo henebabarima no.<verse eid="DAN 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1"/>Na Mediani Dario ahennie afe a ɛdi ɛkan no, meyɛɛ mʼadwene sɛ mɛgyina nʼakyi na mabɔ ne ho ban.)<verse eid="DAN 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anafoɔ Fam Ne Atifi Fam Ahemfo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2"/>“Na afei, mɛka mu nokorɛ akyerɛ wo: ahemfo mmiɛnsa bɛsɔre wɔ Persia, wɔn akyi no, deɛ ɔtɔ so ɛnan a ɔbɛnya ne ho akyɛn nkaeɛ no bɛsɔre. Ɔde nʼahonya mu ahoɔden bɛhwanyane obiara atia Hela ahennie. <verse eid="DAN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3"/>Afei, ɔhene kɛseɛ bi bɛsɔre wɔ tumi mu a ɔbɛyɛ deɛ ɔpɛ. <verse eid="DAN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4"/>Ne ba no akyi, wɔbɛkyekyɛ nʼaheman no mu ɛnan. Ɛrenkɔ nʼasefoɔ nkyɛn, na ɔrennya tumi a na ɔwɔ no, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔbɛtutu nʼaheman no ase de ama afoforɔ.<verse eid="DAN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5"/>“Ɔhene a ɔwɔ anafoɔ fam no bɛyɛ den, nanso nʼasafohene no mu baako bɛyɛ den asene no na ɔde tumi a ɛyɛ den bɛdi ahemman no so. <verse eid="DAN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6"/>Mfeɛ bi akyi no, wɔbɛyɛ ayɔnkofoɔ. Ɔhene a ɔwɔ anafoɔ fam no ba baa bɛkɔ ɔhene a ɔwɔ atifi fam no nkyɛn akɔyɛ nnamfofa apam; nanso ɔbabaa no renkura ne tumi mu bio, na ɔhene a ɔwɔ atifi fam ne ne tumi nso rennyina. Saa mmerɛ no mu no, ɔhene babaa, adehyeɛ a wɔka ne ho, nʼagya ne deɛ ɔgyinaa nʼakyi nyinaa no, wɔbɛyi wɔn ama.<verse eid="DAN 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7"/>“Obi a ɔfiri anafoɔ fam babaa abusua mu bɛsɔre asi nʼanan mu. Na ɔde dom bɛba abɛhyɛne ɔhene a ɔwɔ atifi fam aban no mu na ɔne wɔn ako na wadi wɔn so nkonim. <verse eid="DAN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8"/>Ɔbɛfa wɔn anyame, nsɛsodeɛ a wɔde dadeɛ ayɛ ne wɔn ademudeɛ a wɔde dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ ayɛ akɔ Misraim. Na mfeɛ bi mu no, ɔbɛtwe ne ho afiri ɔhene a ɔwɔ atifi fam ho. <verse eid="DAN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9"/>Afei ɔhene a ɔwɔ atifi fam no bɛto ahyɛ ɔhene a ɔwɔ anafoɔ fam no so, nanso ɔbɛsane nʼakyi akɔ nʼankasa asase so. <verse eid="DAN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10"/>Ne mmammarima bɛsiesie wɔn ho ama ɔko na wɔde akodɔm kɛseɛ bɛkɔ te sɛ nsuo a ayiri, akɔko ara akɔduru atamfoɔ no aban no ho.<verse eid="DAN 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11"/>“Afei, ɔhene a ɔwɔ anafoɔ fam no de abufuo kɛseɛ bɛsɔre na wako atia ɔhene a ɔwɔ atifi fam a ɔno nso wɔ akodɔm kɛseɛ, na ɔbɛdi wɔn so nkonim. <verse eid="DAN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12"/>Sɛ wɔde akodɔm no kɔ a, ahantan bɛhyɛ anafoɔ fam ɔhene no mu ma, na ɔbɛkunkum mpempem, nanso, ne nkonimdie no, ɛnkyɛre. <verse eid="DAN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13"/>Ɔhene a ɔwɔ atifi fam nso bɛboa akodɔm foforɔ a wɔdɔɔso sene kane deɛ no, na mfirinhyia bebree akyi no, ɔde akodɔm kɛseɛ a wɔwɔ akodeɛ bɛtu ɔsa.<verse eid="DAN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14"/>“Saa mmerɛ no mu, bebree bɛsɔre atia ɔhene a ɔwɔ anafoɔ fam. Wɔn a wɔdi akakabensɛm wɔ wʼankasa wo nkurɔfoɔ mu no bɛte atua sɛdeɛ ɛteɛ wɔ anisoadehunu no mu no, nanso wɔrenni nkonim. <verse eid="DAN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15"/>Afei, ɔhene a ɔwɔ atifi fam no bɛba abɛsisi mpie na ɔbɛko agye kuropɔn a wagye ho ban. Akodɔm a wɔwɔ anafoɔ fam no rennya ahoɔden nko, na wɔn a wɔyɛ den wɔ wɔn mu no mpo rentumi nnyina ɔko no ano. <verse eid="DAN 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16"/>Ntohyɛsoni no bɛyɛ deɛ ɔpɛ na obiara ntumi nnyina nʼanim. Ɔbɛgye Asase Fɛɛfɛ no abɔ so, na ɔbɛnya tumi a ɔde bɛsɛe no. <verse eid="DAN 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17"/>Ɔbɛyɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔde ahoɔden a ɔwɔ wɔ nʼahennie no mu nyinaa bɛba, na afei ɔne ɔhene a ɔwɔ anafoɔ fam no akɔyɛ nnamfofa apam. Ɔde ne babaa bɛma no awadeɛ, na ɔnam so agu nʼahennie no, nanso nʼatirimpɔ yi renyɛ yie na ɛremmoa no. <verse eid="DAN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18"/>Afei ɔde nʼani bɛkyerɛ mpoano aman so, na wadi emu bebree so nkonim, nanso, ɔsahene bi de ɔhene yi ahomasoɔ bɛba awieeɛ na wadane abɔ no. <verse eid="DAN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19"/>Yei akyi no, ɔde nʼani bɛkyerɛ aban a ɛwɔ nʼasase so no, nanso ɔbɛsunti ahwe ase, na wɔrenhunu no bio.<verse eid="DAN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20"/>“Deɛ ɔbɛdi nʼadeɛ no bɛsoma ɔtogyeni, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a ɔbɛnya deɛ ɛbɛma nʼahennie no animuonyam atena hɔ. Mfirinhyia kakra bi akyi no, wɔbɛsɛe no; nanso ɛmfiri abufuo anaa ɔko mu.<verse eid="DAN 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21"/>“Obi a wɔmmu no na ɔnnyɛ ɔdehyeɛ na ɔbɛdi nʼadeɛ. Ɔbɛto ahyɛ ahennie no so ɛberɛ a ɛso nnipa no asom adwo wɔn, na ɔde nnaadaa agye. <verse eid="DAN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22"/>Afei ɔbɛtɔre akodɔm a wɔntumi nkan wɔn dodoɔ no ase. Wɔbɛsɛe akodɔm no ne ɔhene babarima a ɔhyɛ bɔhyɛ no ase no. <verse eid="DAN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23"/>Wɔne no yɛ apam wie a, ɔnam nnaadaa ɛkwan so bɛnya nnipa kakra bi na wapere tumi. <verse eid="DAN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24"/>Sɛ amantam a wɔyɛ adefoɔ no te nka sɛ wɔn asom adwo wɔn a, ɔbɛto ahyɛ wɔn so, na deɛ nʼagyanom ne ne nananom antumi anyɛ no, ɔbɛyɛ. Ɔbɛkyekyɛ afodeɛ ne ahonyadeɛ ama nʼakyidifoɔ. Ɔbɛbɔ abantuo ho pɔ, nanso ɛbɛyɛ nna tiawa bi mu.<verse eid="DAN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25"/>“Ɔbɛnya akodɔm kɛseɛ na wanya ahoɔden ne akokoɔduru asɔre atia ɔhene a ɔwɔ anafoɔ fam. Ɔhene a ɔwɔ anafoɔ fam no de akodɔm a wɔdɔɔso na wɔyɛ den bɛtu ɔsa, nanso, ɔrentumi nnyina, ɛsiane ɛpɔ ahodoɔ a wɔabɔ de atia no enti. <verse eid="DAN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26"/>Wɔn a ɔhene bɔ wɔn akɔnhoma no bɛbɔ mmɔden sɛ wɔbɛhwan nʼase; wɔbɛtwi afa ɔhene no asraafoɔ no so, na bebree nso bɛtotɔ wɔ ɔko mu. <verse eid="DAN 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27"/>Ahemfo mmienu a bɔne adi wɔn tiri mu dɛm bɛtena ɛpono baako ho, adi atorɔ akyerɛ wɔn ho wɔn ho, nanso ɛnkɔsi hwee, ɛfiri sɛ, awieeɛ no bɛba ne ɛberɛ a wɔahyɛ no. <verse eid="DAN 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28"/>Ɔhene a ɔwɔ atifi fam no de ahonyadeɛ bebree bɛsane akɔ ne ɔman mu, nanso, nʼakoma rempɛ apam kronkron no. Ɔbɛyɛ biribi atia apam kronkron no na wasane akɔ ne ɔman mu.<verse eid="DAN 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29"/>“Ɛberɛ a wɔahyɛ no duru a, ɔbɛto ahyɛ anafoɔ aman so bio, nanso saa ɛberɛ yi deɛ, ɛrenyɛ yie mma no sɛ kane no. <verse eid="DAN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30"/>Ahyɛn a wɔfiri aman a ɛwɔ mpoano wɔ atɔeɛ fam no bɛko atia no, na nʼabasa mu bɛbu. Enti ɔbɛsane nʼakyi na ɔde nʼabufuo akɔwie apam kronkron no so, na ɔne wɔn a wɔpo apam kronkron no bɛyɛ baako.<verse eid="DAN 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31"/>“Na nʼasraadɔm bɛsɔre. Wɔbɛgu asɔredan no aban ho fi, na wɔagu daadaa afɔrebɔ no. Wɔde abusudeɛ a ɛde ɔsɛeɛ ba bɛsi anan mu. <verse eid="DAN 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32"/>Ɔde nnaadaa bɛkɔ so asɛe wɔn a wɔbu apam no so, nanso wɔn a wɔnim wɔn Onyankopɔn no bɛsɔre atia no dendeenden.<verse eid="DAN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33"/>“Anyansafoɔ bɛkyerɛkyerɛ bebree, nanso, berɛ bi mu no, wɔbɛtotɔ akofena ano, wɔbɛhye wɔn, wɔbɛfa wɔn nnommum anaa wɔbɛfom wɔn nneɛma. <verse eid="DAN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34"/>Sɛ wɔhwe ase a, wɔbɛnya mmoa kakra, na bebree a wɔnni nokorɛ bɛkɔ akɔdɔm wɔn. <verse eid="DAN 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35"/>Anyansafoɔ no mu bi bɛsuntisunti. Ɛnam so bɛma wɔasiesie wɔn, ahohoro wɔn ho fi na wɔayɛ wɔn a wɔn ho nni nkekaawa akɔsi awieeɛ berɛ no, ɛfiri sɛ ɛbɛba ɛberɛ a wɔahyɛ no.<verse eid="DAN 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔhene A Ɔma Ne Ho So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36"/>“Ɔhene no bɛyɛ deɛ ɔpɛ, ɔbɛma ne ho so, ayɛ ne ho kɛseɛ asene onyame biara, na waka deɛ obi ntee da afa anyame mu Onyame no ho. Ɔbɛnya nkɔsoɔ akɔsi sɛ abufuo berɛ no bɛba awieeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ deɛ wɔahyɛ ato hɔ no ba mu. <verse eid="DAN 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37"/>Ɔbɛbu nʼagyanom anyame animtia. Ɔremfa mmaa no nyame a wɔdɔ no anaa onyame foforɔ biara nyɛ hwee, na mmom ɔbɛma ne ho so aboro wɔn nyinaa so. <verse eid="DAN 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38"/>Ɔde aban no nyame, nyame a nʼagyanom nnim bɛsi wɔn anan mu; ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ, dwetɛ, aboɔdemmoɔ ne akyɛdeɛ a ɛsom bo bɛdi no ni. <verse eid="DAN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39"/>Ɔde mmoa a ɔnya firi ananafoɔ nyame hɔ no bɛto ahyɛ aban a ɛyɛ den pa ara so, na wɔn a wɔgye no to mu no, ɔbɛhyɛ wɔn animuonyam. Ɔbɛyɛ wɔn sodifoɔ wɔ nnipa bebree so, na ɔbɛkyekyɛ asase no mu de ayɛ akatua.<verse eid="DAN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40"/>“Awieeɛ no duru a, ɔhene a ɔwɔ anafoɔ fam no ne no bɛko, na ɔhene a ɔwɔ atifi fam no nso de nteaseɛnam, apɔnkɔsotefoɔ ne ɛpo so akodɔm bebree ahyia no. Ɔbɛto ahyɛ aman bebree so na watwi afa wɔn so te sɛ nsuyire. <verse eid="DAN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41"/>Ɔbɛto ahyɛ Asase Fɛɛfɛ no so. Aman bebree bɛhwehwe ase, nanso wɔbɛgye Edom, Moab ne Amon mu fa kɛseɛ afiri ne nsa mu. <verse eid="DAN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42"/>Ɔde ne tumi bɛkɔ aman bebree so; na Misraim remfiri mu mfi. <verse eid="DAN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43"/>Ɔde ne nsa bɛto ademudeɛ a ɛyɛ sikakɔkɔɔ, dwetɛ ne Misraim ahonyadeɛ nyinaa so, na Libiafoɔ ne Etiopiafoɔ ayɛ nʼasomfoɔ. <verse eid="DAN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44"/>Nanso, amaneɛ a ɔbɛte afiri apueeɛ ne atifi fam bɛbɔ no hu, na ɔde abufuhyeɛ bɛfiri akɔ akɔsɛe bebree atɔre wɔn ase. <verse eid="DAN 11:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45"/>Ɔbɛsi nʼadehye ntomadan wɔ ɛpo no ne bepɔ kronkron fɛfɛ no ntam. Na nʼawieeɛ bɛba a ɔrennya mmoa biara.<verse eid="DAN 11:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Awieeɛ Mmerɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1"/>“Saa ɛberɛ no, Mikael, ɔhene babarima titire a ɔbɔ wo nkurɔfoɔ ho ban no bɛsɔre. Ahohia ɛberɛ bi bɛba a, ɛfiri aman no ahyɛaseɛ bɛsi saa da no, biribiara saa nsiiɛ da. Nanso saa ɛberɛ no, wo nkurɔfoɔ, obiara a wɔbɛhunu sɛ wɔatwerɛ ne din wɔ nwoma no mu no, wɔbɛgye no nkwa. <verse eid="DAN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2"/>Nnipadɔm a wɔadeda fam wɔ dɔteɛ mu no bɛnyane: ebinom bɛkɔ daa nkwa mu, na ebinom nso akɔ aniwuo ne daa ahohora mu. <verse eid="DAN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3"/>Wɔn a wɔyɛ anyansafoɔ no bɛhyerɛn te sɛ ɔsoro hyerɛn, na wɔn a wɔdanee afoforɔ kɔɔ tenenee mu no bɛhyerɛn sɛ nsoromma daapem. <verse eid="DAN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4"/>Nanso, wo Daniel, bobɔ na sɔ nsɛm a ɛwɔ nwoma mmobɔeɛ no ano, kɔsi awieeɛ ɛberɛ no. Bebree bɛkyinkyini akɔpɛ nimdeɛ.”<verse eid="DAN 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5"/>Afei, me Daniel mehwɛ hunuu nnipa baanu bi wɔ mʼanim; ɔbaako gyina asubɔnten no konkɔn so, na ɔbaako nso gyina konkɔn a ɛhwɛ baako no anim no so. <verse eid="DAN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6"/>Wɔn mu baako bisaa ɔbarima a ɔfira nwera no a ɔgyina asuo no so no sɛ, “Ɛbɛdi nna ahe ansa na anwanwadeɛ yi aba mu?”<verse eid="DAN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7"/>Ɔbarima no a ɔfira nwera na ɔwɔ nsuo no so no maa ne nsa nifa ne benkum so kyerɛɛ soro, na metee sɛ ɔde deɛ ɔte hɔ daa no kaa ntam sɛ, “Ɛbɛkɔ so saa ara akɔsi ɛberɛ bi, mmerɛ bi ne ɛberɛ sini bi. Sɛ nnipa kronkron no tumi sɛeɛ no ba awieeɛ koraa a, wɔbɛwie saa nneɛma yi nyinaa.”<verse eid="DAN 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8"/>Meteeɛ, nanso mante aseɛ. Enti, mebisaa sɛ, “Me Wura ɛdeɛn na ɛbɛfiri yeinom nyinaa mu aba?”<verse eid="DAN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9"/>Na ɔbuaa sɛ, “Daniel kɔ, ɛfiri sɛ wɔabobɔ nsɛm no asɔ ano de akɔsi awieeɛ mmerɛ no. <verse eid="DAN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10"/>Wɔbɛhohoro bebree ho a efi ne nkekaeɛ biara nni wɔn ho, nanso atirimuɔdenfoɔ bɛkɔ so ayɛ atirimuɔden; wɔn mu biara rente aseɛ, nanso anyansafoɔ deɛ, wɔbɛte aseɛ.<verse eid="DAN 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11"/>“Ɛfiri da a wɔbɛbra daa afɔrebɔ na wɔde akyiwadeɛ a ɔsɛeɛ nam ne so bɛba abɛsi hɔ no bɛyɛ nnafua apem ahanu aduɔkron. <verse eid="DAN 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12"/>Nhyira ne deɛ ɔtwɛn kɔsi nnafua apem ahasa aduasa enum awieeɛ no.<verse eid="DAN 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13"/>“Wo Daniel deɛ, tintim kɔduru awieeɛ. Wobɛhome, na nna no awieeɛ no, wobɛsɔre na woakɔgye wo kyɛfa a ɛwɔ agyapadeɛ no mu.”<verse eid="DAN 12:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12"/>
</usx>
